  "All trays are open. Replay any order to master every star.": "所有托盤均打開。重玩任何指令來掌握每顆星星。",
  "Almost leveled up: collect one more crystal and pick a stronger ability.": "幾乎升級了：再收集一顆水晶並選擇更強的能力。",
  "Already reached maximum level": "已經達到最高等級",
  "Amazing progress! This is a new best score for this stage.": "進步驚人！這是本階段新的最佳成績。",
