  "Basic play does not require an account. Unlocked and completed stages, Workshop XP, discoveries, and best encounter progress are stored in this browser; clearing site storage or changing devices may remove that profile. Gold and the current loadout are temporary. Diamonds are optional and require confirmation at Orla's refresh.": "基本遊戲不需要帳號。已解鎖和已完成的階段、創意工坊 XP、發現和最佳遭遇進度都儲存在此瀏覽器中；清除網站儲存或更改裝置可能會刪除該設定檔。黃金和當前的負載是暫時的。鑽石是可選的，需要在奧拉刷新時確認。",
  "Basilisk controls ground with venom, Guardian drops its guard after slams, Colossus exposes a core, Wyvern alternates flight and landing, Stag breaks its shield on a failed dash, and Behemoth combines phase-based crystal and root pressure.": "蛇怪用毒液控制地面，守護者在猛擊後放棄防禦，巨像暴露核心，飛龍交替飛行和著陸，雄鹿在衝刺失敗時打破盾牌，巨獸結合了基於相位的水晶和根壓力。",
  "Basilisk controls ground with venom, Stone Guardian drops its guard after slams, Thorn Colossus exposes a core, Cinder Wyvern alternates flight and landing, Eclipse Stag breaks its shield on a failed dash, and Behemoth combines phase-based crystal and root pressure.": "蛇怪用毒液控制地面，石像守護者在猛擊後失去防禦，荊棘巨像暴露核心，灰燼雙足飛龍交替飛行和著陸，日蝕雄鹿在衝刺失敗時打破其護盾，而巨獸則結合了基於相位的水晶和根部壓力。",
