  "Beast Deck: The Mist Forest": "野獸套牌：迷霧森林",
  "Beast Deck: The Mist Forest - Game Guide": "野獸牌組：迷霧森林 - 遊戲指南",
  "Beast Deck: The Mist Forest - WeightPlay": "野獸牌組：迷霧森林 - WeightPlay",
  "Beast Deck: The Mist Forest game guide": "野獸甲板：霧森林遊戲指南",
  "Beast Deck: The Mist Forest is a 30-mission turn-based deckbuilding campaign built around visible enemy intent and animal-power card combos. Each mission contains three battles and two temporary drafts. Six five-mission regions introduce armor, riposte, Exhaust, marks, regeneration, cleanse, Weak, seals, curses and triad wards. Missions 5, 10, 15, 20, 25 and 30 end with different phase-changing Bosses.": "野獸牌組：迷霧森林是一款包含 30 個任務的回合製牌組構建戰役，圍繞著明顯的敵人意圖和動物力量卡牌組合而構建。每個任務包含三場戰鬥和兩次臨時草案。六個五任務區域引入了護甲、回擊、耗盡、標記、再生、淨化、虛弱、封印、詛咒和三合會守衛。任務 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 以不同的階段變化 Boss 結束。",
  "Beast Guardian": "野獸守護者",
  "Beast Guardian - Free Hero Tower Defense | WeightPlay": "野獸守護者-免費英雄塔防| WPB品牌代幣",
  "Beast Guardian - Game Guide": "野獸守護者 - 遊戲指南",
  "Beast Guardian cover": "野獸守護者封面",
  "Beast Guardian game guide": "野獸守護者遊戲指南",
  "Beast Guardian is a 30-stage hero tower-defense campaign built around route construction rather than fixed tower pads. Each stage changes both the enemy entry and crystal position, so the same wall pattern cannot solve every map. Build from eight clear animal roles, keep at least one route open, and protect the crystal through six five-stage regions. Wolves, armored boars, flying bats, regenerating packs, wounded sprinters, and eclipse formations ask for different defenses. Stages 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30 end with rule-changing Bosses instead of ordinary enemies with larger health bars.": "《野獸守護者》是一場 30 階段的英雄塔防戰役，圍繞著路線建造而不是固定的塔樓進行。每個階段都會改變敵人的進入和水晶位置，因此相同的牆壁圖案無法解決所有地圖。由八個明確的動物角色構建，保持至少一條路線暢通，並通過六個五階段區域保護水晶。狼、裝甲野豬、飛行蝙蝠、再生群體、受傷的短跑選手和日食隊形需要不同的防禦。第 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 階段以改變規則的 Boss 結束，而不是具有較大生命值的普通敵人。",
  "Beast Guardian is a 30-stage hero tower-defense campaign built around route construction rather than fixed tower pads. Place four ordinary animal soldier roles and seven WeightPlay heroes on a forest grid, keep at least one route open, and protect the crystal core through six five-stage regions. Wolves, armored boars, flying bats, regenerating packs, wounded sprinters, and eclipse formations ask for different defenses. Stages 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30 end with rule-changing Bosses instead of ordinary enemies with larger health bars.": "《野獸守護者》是一場 30 階段的英雄塔防戰役，圍繞著路線建造而不是固定的塔樓進行。將四個普通動物士兵角色和七個WeightPlay英雄放置在森林網格上，保持至少一條路線暢通，並通過六個五級區域保護水晶核心。狼、裝甲野豬、飛行蝙蝠、再生群體、受傷的短跑選手和日食隊形需要不同的防禦。第 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 階段以改變規則的 Boss 結束，而不是具有較大生命值的普通敵人。",
  "Beast Guardian tower defense board": "野獸守護者塔防板",
  "Beast guide": "野獸嚮導",
  "Beast Guide": "野獸指南",
  "Beasts {defeated}/{total}": "獸 {defeated}/{total}",
  "Because this game practices {skill}, try these next:": "因為這個遊戲練習{skill}，所以接下來試試這些：",
  "Before entering a narrow branch, check whether another unused trail can bring the route back to the main constellation.": "在進入狹窄的分支之前，檢查是否有另一條未使用的路徑可以將路線帶回主星座。",
  "Before entering a narrow branch, check whether you will still have a way back to the rest of the constellation.": "在進入狹窄的分支之前，檢查是否還有路返回星座的其餘部分。",
  "Before the first move, trace a route that includes required fruit and still leaves a legal approach to home.": "在第一次搬家之前，追蹤一條路線，其中包括所需的水果，但仍保留合法的回家路徑。",
