  "Behavior Clue": "行為線索",
  "Bell warnings are decisions, not decoration. If a pulse is near, enter a shadow circle before taking the next long route; the pulse raises Alert only outside cover.": "鈴聲警告是決定，而不是裝飾。如果脈衝很近，則在走下一條長路線之前進入陰影圈；脈衝僅在掩體外發出警報。",
