  "Card Collection": "卡片收藏",
  "Card interactions: Wolf Pack deals 6 damage, or 12 after another Attack. Sky Hawk deals 14 and draws one. Guard Bear grants 6 Block, Iron Tortoise 15, Cheetah Sprint draws two and refunds one Energy, Viper Venom applies three Poison, and Owl Wisdom draws one for free. Poison triggers after the enemy action; enemy Block absorbs a fixed amount.": "卡牌互動：狼群造成 6 點傷害，或在另一次攻擊後造成 12 點傷害。天鷹發牌 14 平 1。護衛熊提供 6 格，鐵龜 15，獵豹衝刺抽取 2 點並返還 1 點能量，毒蛇毒液施加 3 點毒藥，貓頭鷹智慧免費抽取 1 點。敵人行動後觸發毒藥；敵方方塊吸收固定數量。",
