  "Cast and clock: an expedition begins with 90 seconds, plus five seconds for each Boat Range level above Level 1. Hold the water or Space to charge and release to cast. More power shortens bite delay; it does not select a rarer fish.": "施法與計時：探險開始時間為 90 秒，每級船靶場等級高於 1 級則加 5 秒。按住水或空間蓄力並釋放以施法。更大的力量縮短了咬合延遲；它不會選擇更稀有的魚。",
  "Cast first, then keep the marker centered.": "先投射，然後將標記保持在中心位置。",
  "Cast into the coral reef and build your sea-creature album.": "投入珊瑚礁並建立您的海洋生物相簿。",
  "Cat": "貓",
  "Cat is the dependable ranged guard, and every fourth seed can pierce a second target. Dog has the health to block a lane at close range and briefly slows with each bite. Owl fires quickly and applies a lighter slow, which creates time against rushers. Fox costs shared diamonds to unlock, but its second shot can support a neighboring lane. These roles matter more than filling every tile: a Dog and Cat pair can hold one lane, while Owl and Fox help when pressure moves between lanes.": "貓是可靠的遠程守衛，每四個種子就可以刺穿第二個目標。狗的生命值足以在近距離阻擋車道，並且每咬一口都會短暫減慢速度。貓頭鷹的射擊速度很快，而且速度較慢，這為對抗衝鋒者創造了時間。福克斯需要共享鑽石來解鎖，但它的第二次射擊可以支撐鄰近的車道。這些角色比填滿每一塊更重要：一對狗和貓可以佔據一條車道，而貓頭鷹和狐狸在壓力在車道之間移動時提供幫助。",
  "Cat, Bear, Owl, Lion, Penguin, and Koala each guard one five-stage lesson. Passing a Keeper Check repairs that part of the sky. Completing the final Koala Grand Star Check means all twelve animal constellations have returned to their proper routes.": "貓、熊、貓頭鷹、獅子、企鵝和無尾熊各守衛一堂分為五個階段的課程。通過守護者檢查可以修復那部分天空。完成最後的無尾熊大星檢查意味著所有十二個動物星座都已返回正確的路線。",
  "Cat, Bear, Owl, Lion, Penguin, and Koala each guard one five-stage lesson. Passing their Keeper Check repairs a new section of the sky. Completing the Koala Grand Star Check at Stage 30 means panda, cat, bear, lion, rabbit, fox, owl, frog, whale, chick, penguin, and koala lights can guide their animal friends again.": "貓、熊、貓頭鷹、獅子、企鵝和無尾熊各守衛一堂分為五個階段的課程。透過守護者檢查可以修復天空的新部分。在第 30 階段完成無尾熊大星星檢查意味著熊貓、貓、熊、獅子、兔子、狐狸、貓頭鷹、青蛙、鯨魚、小雞、企鵝和無尾熊燈可以再次引導他們的動物朋友。",
  "Catch landed! Keep going before time runs out.": "捕獲落地！在時間用完之前繼續前進。",
  "Catch Value": "捕捉價值",
  "Caught {fish}": "捕捉{fish}",
  "Center lanes get crowded. Build the middle first, then sides.": "中心車道變得擁擠。先建中間，再建兩側。",
