  "Challenge {stage}": "挑戰{stage}",
  "Challenge Clear!": "挑戰清除！",
  "Challenge Complete!": "挑戰完成！",
  "Challenge mode adds a goal, drop budget, saved unlock path, and authored physics or queue rules. Free Play remains an unlimited best-score run.": "挑戰模式增加了目標、降低預算、保存的解鎖路徑以及編寫的實體或佇列規則。免費遊戲仍然是無限的最佳成績運行。",
  "Challenge Retry": "挑戰重試",
  "Challenge selection": "挑戰選擇",
  "Challenge Spotlight": "挑戰焦點",
  "Challenge unlocks, completion, selection, and best scores remain in this browser. Free Play keeps its separate local album and best-run list.": "挑戰解鎖、完成、選擇和最佳成績均保留在該瀏覽器中。 Free Play 保留其單獨的本地專輯和最佳運行清單。",
  "Challenges": "挑戰",
  "Challenges 1-5 teach the open box and finish at Meadow Drum.": "挑戰 1-5 教授開箱並在 Meadow Drum 結束。",
  "Challenges 1-5 teach tickets, care, and habitat movement before Mimi's first review. Challenges 6-10 compare care choices, ask the player to hold a ready ticket box, and introduce the Snack Stand before Panko's picnic.": "挑戰 1-5 在 Mimi 第一次複習之前教授門票、護理和棲息地移動。挑戰 6-10 比較護理選擇，要求玩家持有準備好的票箱，並在 Panko 野餐之前介紹小吃攤。",
  "Challenges 1-5, Meadow Steps:": "挑戰 1-5，草地階梯：",
  "Challenges 1–5 introduce ticket collection, one care action, habitat movement, and the first Mimi review. Challenges 6–10 ask players to compare care routes, hold a ready ticket box, and improve the Snack Stand before Panko's picnic review.": "挑戰 1-5 介紹了門票收集、一次護理行動、棲息地移動和第一次 Mimi 評論。挑戰 6-10 要求玩家在 Panko 野餐回顧之前比較護理路線、準備票箱並改進小吃攤。",
  "Challenges 11-15 add alternating River Current force.": "挑戰 11-15 增加交替河流力。",
  "Challenges 11-15 introduce the View Deck, larger arrangements, and happiness targets. Challenges 16-20 add the Keeper Post and combine care, animal count, and facility planning for the rhino keeper audit.": "挑戰 11-15 介紹了觀景台、更大的安排和幸福目標。挑戰 16-20 增加了飼養員崗位，並將護理、動物計數和設施規劃結合起來，以進行犀牛飼養員審核。",
  "Challenges 11-15, River Current:": "挑戰 11-15，河川：",
  "Challenges 11–15 add the View Deck, larger arrangements, and happiness targets. Challenges 16–20 bring in the Keeper Post and require care, animal count, and facility planning together. Challenges 21–25 focus on gate growth, a busier animal roster, and the penguin parade. Challenges 26–30 combine careful spending, all three facilities, happiness, arrangement, and income in the Grand Safari Festival finale.": "挑戰 11-15 增加了觀景台、更大的安排和幸福目標。挑戰 16-20 引入了守護者崗位，需要同時進行護理、動物計數和設施規劃。挑戰 21-25 重點關注大門的增長、更繁忙的動物名冊和企鵝遊行。挑戰 26-30 在 Grand Safari Festival 的結局中結合了謹慎的消費、所有三個設施、幸福、安排和收入。",
  "Challenges 16-20 use faster Mountain Weight gravity.": "挑戰 16-20 使用更快的 Mountain Weight 重力。",
  "Challenges 16-20, Mountain Weight:": "挑戰 16-20，山地重量：",
  "Challenges 21-25 grow the gate and animal roster for a penguin parade. Challenges 26-30 combine careful spending, all three facilities, happiness, arrangement, and income in the Grand Safari Festival finale.": "挑戰 21-25 增加企鵝遊行的大門和動物名冊。挑戰 26-30 在 Grand Safari Festival 的結局中結合了謹慎的消費、所有三個設施、幸福、安排和收入。",
  "Challenges 21-25 use the predictable Moon Parade queue.": "挑戰 21-25 使用可預測的月球巡遊隊列。",
  "Challenges 21-25, Moon Parade:": "挑戰 21-25，月球巡遊：",
  "Challenges 26-30 combine advanced rules, with all four active at the Lion Crown Table finale.": "挑戰 26-30 結合了高級規則，所有四個挑戰都活躍在獅冠桌決賽中。",
  "Challenges 26-30, Crown Festival:": "挑戰 26-30，皇冠節：",
  "Challenges 6-10 use the reduced Forest Window aim range.": "挑戰 6-10 使用縮小的森林窗口目標範圍。",
  "Challenges 6-10, Forest Window:": "挑戰 6-10，森林之窗：",
  "Challenges add goals, drop budgets, saved unlocks, and authored rules; Free Play remains unlimited.": "挑戰會增加目標、減少預算、保存解鎖內容和編寫規則；免費遊戲仍然不受限制。",
  "Changing lane!": "變換車道！",
  "Changing Tray missions reorder them after a wrong choice so the next decision uses observation.": "更改托盤任務會在錯誤選擇後重新排序，以便下一個決定需要觀察。",
  "Changing Tray missions reorder them after a wrong choice.": "更改托盤任務在選擇錯誤後重新排序。",
  "Chapter {chapter}: {name}": "第{chapter}章：{name}",
