  "Character backpack items": "角色背包物品",
  "Character level is permanent. Spend level points here so every run starts stronger.": "角色等級是永久的。在這裡花費等級點數，這樣每次跑步都會變得更強。",
  "Character Stats": "角色統計",
  "Charge lane marked — the Guardian is vulnerable after its rush.": "衝鋒線已標記－守護者在衝鋒後容易受到攻擊。",
