  "Charging Buffalo": "衝鋒水牛",
  "Chart 30 reef missions and land six Guardian fish.": "繪製 30 個珊瑚礁任務並登陸 6 條守護者魚。",
  "Check a cloud’s whole row before striking it.": "在擊中雲之前檢查它的整排。",
  "Check current and next bubbles before choosing an angle.": "在選擇角度之前檢查當前和下一個氣泡。",
  "Check each customer&#39;s food bubble, VIP mark, table mark, and patience bar.": "檢查每位顧客的食物氣泡、VIP標記、餐桌標記和耐心條。",
  "Check for a VIP before preparing a normal guest&#39;s tray.": "在準備普通客人的托盤之前先檢查是否有 VIP。",
  "Check the food pictures above each customer.": "檢查每位顧客上方的食物圖片。",
  "Check word": "檢查字",
  "Checkpoint": "檢查站",
  "Checkpoint goals need balance. Watch both counters and change priorities when either collection or score falls behind.": "檢查點目標需要平衡。觀察兩個計數器並在收集或分數落後時更改優先順序。",
  "Checkpoint goals require both an animal tier and points. A single large merge may satisfy the tier while a planned combo supplies the remaining score.": "檢查站目標需要動物等級和積分。單一大型合併可能會滿足該等級，而計劃的組合則提供剩餘分數。",
  "Checkpoints combine learned rules without combat. Targets retain forgiving hit perimeters, hints name and ring one target, held keys cannot spend both hints or skip Result, and reduced-motion preferences stop patrol movement. The Stage rail shows all 30 challenges even when later cards are locked, while unlocks, stars, and best times stay local to the current browser.": "檢查點結合了學到的規則，無需戰鬥。目標保留寬容的命中範圍，提示名稱並響鈴一個目標，按住的鍵不能同時使用提示或跳過結果，並且減少運動首選項停止巡邏運動。即使後來的卡片被鎖定，舞台軌道也會顯示所有 30 個挑戰，而解鎖、星星和最佳時間則保留在當前瀏覽器本地。",
  "Cheese": "起司",
  "Cheetah Sprint": "獵豹衝刺",
  "Chest gear is claimed before the equip decision. Keeping the current loadout does not discard a new item; it remains in the backpack for later comparison.": "胸部裝備在裝備決定前就已領取。保持當前的裝載量不會丟棄新物品；它保留在背包中以供以後比較。",
