  "Choose a mission, move animal heroes on the rune grid, and clear enemies with smart positioning.": "選擇一個任務，在符文網格上移動動物英雄，並透過智慧定位清除敵人。",
  "Choose a nearby tile.": "選擇附近的瓷磚。",
