  "Choose a raid route, plan ricochet shots, and protect the fortress core.": "選擇攻擊路線，計劃跳彈射擊，並保護要塞核心。",
  "Choose a reef zone, control line tension, earn Reef Notes, and upgrade your gear locally.": "選擇珊瑚礁區域，控制繩索張力，賺取珊瑚礁筆記，並在當地升級您的裝備。",
  "Choose a Relic Upgrade": "選擇聖物升級",
  "Choose a route, swim through three zones, use sonar before a risky pocket, and surface with your salvage.": "選擇一條路線，遊過三個區域，在危險區域前使用聲納，然後帶著你的救援物資浮出水面。",
  "Choose a Rune Reward": "選擇符文獎勵",
  "Choose a Safari Route": "選擇 Safari 路線",
  "Choose a shift": "選擇班次",
  "Choose a shift, read each flight request, then guide the airship to the highlighted matching dock before congestion builds.": "選擇班次，閱讀每個航班請求，然後在擁堵之前將飛艇引導至突出顯示的匹配碼頭。",
  "Choose a snack stage.": "選擇一個小吃階段。",
  "Choose a stage from the swipe stage rail and read the threat, plan, and reward notes.": "從滑動式舞台導軌中選擇一個舞台並閱讀威脅、計劃和獎勵說明。",
  "Choose a star and continue through connected stars. A star may be visited more than once, but every connecting trail may be crossed only once. The constellation is complete only after all trails are lit in one continuous route.": "選擇一顆星星並繼續瀏覽連接的星星。一顆恆星可能會被多次訪問，但每條連接路徑只能被穿越一次。只有在一條連續路線上的所有路徑都被照亮後，星座才算完整。",
  "Choose a target to swim into. Compare both signals; use SONAR when unsure.": "選擇一個要遊入的目標。比較兩個訊號；不確定時使用 SONAR。",
  "Choose a trail": "選擇一條路線",
  "Choose a workshop puzzle": "選擇一個創意工坊拼圖",
  "Choose a zoo shift from the stage list.": "從階段清單中選擇動物園班次。",
