  "Choose an animal, pick a color, then tap the animal to color it": "選擇一種動物，選擇一種顏色，然後點擊該動物為其著色",
  "Choose an animal, pick colors, and make it yours.": "選擇一種動物，選擇顏色，然後將其變成你的。",
  "Choose an animal, then tap a grass tile.": "選擇一種動物，然後點選草塊。",
  "Choose an expedition": "選擇探險",
  "Choose an Expedition Relic": "選擇遠徵遺跡",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the 30-stage horizontal expedition rail and read its route rule.": "從30級水平探險鐵路中選擇一張解鎖卡並閱讀其路線規則。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the horizontal 30-stage rail and read its rule.": "從水平 30 級軌道中選擇一張未鎖定的卡片並閱讀其規則。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the horizontal 30-stage rail; every fifth card is a Boss checkpoint.": "從水平30軌道中選擇一張解鎖卡；每五張卡片就是一個 Boss 檢查點。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the horizontal 30-trial rail and read its region rule, checkpoint Boss, and suggested hero.": "從水平的 30 個試煉軌道中選擇一張解鎖的卡牌，並閱讀其區域規則、檢查點 Boss 和建議的英雄。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the horizontal Stage rail. Locked cards remain visible so the length of the 30-stage route and each fifth-stage Boss checkpoint are clear.": "從水平舞台導軌中選擇一張未鎖定的卡片。鎖定的卡牌仍然可見，因此 30 階段路線的長度和每個第五階段 Boss 檢查點都清晰可見。",
  "Choose an unlocked card on the horizontal 30-board Stage rail and read its rule.": "在水平 30 板舞台導軌上選擇一張未鎖定的卡片並閱讀其規則。",
