  "Choose an unlocked mission from the 30-card Moon Archive rail and read its rule.": "從 30 張卡片的月球檔案軌道中選擇一個解鎖任務並閱讀其規則。",
  "Choose an unlocked puzzle from the horizontal Stage rail.": "從水平舞台導軌中選擇一個解鎖的謎題。",
