  "Choose an unlocked route from the horizontal fortress map. Read its name, rule tag, and route-specific warning before entering.": "從水平要塞地圖中選擇一條未鎖定的路線。進入前請閱讀其名稱、規則標籤和特定路線的警告。",
  "Choose an unlocked route from the horizontal Stage rail and read its objective and rules.": "從水平舞台軌道上選擇一條未鎖定的路線並閱讀其目標和規則。",
