  "Choose an unlocked stage from the horizontal rail.": "從水平導軌上選擇一個未鎖定的舞台。",
  "Choose an unlocked stage from the horizontal route rail. Its card names the region rule, key target, and whether a Boss is waiting.": "從水平路線軌道上選擇一個未鎖定的舞台。它的卡片上標明了區域規則、關鍵目標以及 Boss 是否在等待。",
  "Choose an unlocked stage from the swipe rail, then begin the defense. Cleared non-final waves start automatically after a five-second countdown.": "從滑動軌道上選擇一個未鎖定的階段，然後開始防禦。已清除的非最終波數會在五秒倒數後自動開始。",
  "Choose an unlocked stage on the horizontal stage trail and read its enemy icons and short plan.": "在水平舞台軌跡上選擇一個未鎖定的舞台，並閱讀其敵人圖示和簡短計劃。",
