  "Choose any unlocked mission from the horizontal reef map. The card states its sea condition, catch goal, and whether a Guardian is waiting. Winning unlocks exactly the next mission; earlier missions remain replayable.": "從水平珊瑚礁地圖中選擇任何解鎖的任務。該卡說明了其海況、捕獲目標以及守護者是否正在等待。獲勝即可解鎖下一個任務；早期的任務仍可重玩。",
  "Choose any unlocked stage from the horizontal card rail.": "從水平卡軌中選擇任何未鎖定的階段。",
