  "Choose Rod Strength or Bait Quality when safe fights take too long; choose Reel Control or Line Durability when the marker repeatedly escapes SAFE.": "當安全戰鬥花費太長時間時，選擇魚竿強度或魚餌品質；當標記反覆脫離安全時，選擇捲軸控製或線耐用性。",
  "Choose Stage": "選擇階段",
  "Choose Start Game for the challenge rail or Free Play for an unlimited score run.": "選擇“開始遊戲”進行挑戰，或選擇“免費遊戲”以獲得無限分數。",
  "Choose Start Game to open the horizontal challenge rail, or choose Free Play for the original unlimited score run.": "選擇「開始遊戲」以開啟水平挑戰欄，或選擇「免費遊戲」以進行原始的無限得分運行。",
