  "Choose the Gearwood route.": "選擇 Gearwood 路線。",
  "Choose the item that handles the immediate priority described by both clues.": "選擇處理兩條線索所描述的直接優先順序的項目。",
  "Choose the matching station": "選擇相符的電台",
  "Choose Tidy Habitat to raise happiness, or Enrichment Time to earn tickets; each care action has a short cooldown.": "選擇「整潔棲息地」來提升幸福感，或選擇「豐富時光」來賺取門票；每個護理動作都有短暫的冷卻時間。",
  "Choose Tidy Habitat when happiness is required, but Enrichment Time when income is the bottleneck.": "當需要幸福時選擇整潔棲息地，當收入成為瓶頸時選擇豐富時間。",
