  "Choose Trial": "選擇試用",
  "Choose two matching free tiles.": "選擇兩個匹配的免費瓷磚。",
  "Choose whether the optional treasure is worth the detour. It awards the third medal and extra Moon Coins, but ordinary mission progress never requires it unless the current rule explicitly turns it into a seal.": "選擇可選的寶藏是否值得繞道而行。它獎勵第三枚獎章和額外的月亮幣，但普通的任務進度從來不需要它，除非當前的規則明確將其變成封印。",
  "Choose your age": "選擇您的年齡",
  "Choose your age, meet animal heroes, and start playing. No ads or sign-in.": "選擇你的年齡，認識動物英雄，然後開始玩。沒有廣告或登入。",
  "Choose your next game": "選擇您的下一款遊戲",
  "Claim": "索賠",
  "Claim any completed milestone; claiming never resets the park or other milestone progress.": "領取任何已完成的里程碑；聲稱永遠不會重置公園或其他里程碑進度。",
  "Claim the reward after every goal is complete, then continue to the next challenge.": "完成每個目標後領取獎勵，然後繼續下一個挑戰。",
