  "Confirm +{points} Points": "確認 +{points} 積分",
  "Confirm 3 · {before}→{after}": "確認3·{before}→{after}",
  "Confirm Core Revive. Restore the core to 35 HP. Spend 5 Diamonds. Balance {balance} to {result}.": "確認核心復活。將核心HP恢復至35。花費 5 鑽石。平衡 {balance} 到 {result}。",
  "Confirm Crystal Charm. Spend 12 Diamonds. Balance {before} to {after}.": "確認水晶符。花費12鑽石。平衡 {before} 到 {after}。",
  "Confirm Emergency Beacon. Spend 3 Diamonds. Balance {before} to {after}.": "確認緊急信標。花費3鑽石。平衡 {before} 到 {after}。",
  "Confirm Golden Defender Frame. Spend 15 Diamonds. Balance {balance} to {result}.": "確認黃金防御者框架。花費15鑽石。平衡 {balance} 到 {result}。",
  "Confirm Lure · {before}→{after}D": "確認誘餌·{before}→{after}D",
  "Confirm Mist Amulet permanent upgrade. Spend 15 Diamonds. Balance {before} to {after}.": "確認迷霧護身符永久升級。花費15鑽石。平衡 {before} 到 {after}。",
  "Confirm Mist Amulet. Permanent plus 10 Max HP. Spend {cost} Diamonds. Balance {balance} to {result}.": "確認迷霧護身符。永久加 10 最大生命值。花費 {cost} 鑽石。平衡 {balance} 到 {result}。",
  "Confirm one blessing reroll. Spend 3 Diamonds. Balance {before} to {after}.": "確認一次祝福重投。花費3鑽石。平衡 {before} 到 {after}。",
  "Confirm permanent boost · Diamonds {before} → {after}. Tap again.": "確認永久提升·鑽石{before}→{after}。再次點擊。",
  "Confirm permanent Training Slot. Diamonds {before} to {after}.": "確認永久訓練槽位。鑽石 {before} 至 {after}。",
  "Confirm Rare Lure. Spend 3 Diamonds. Balance {before} to {after}.": "確認稀有誘餌。花費3鑽石。平衡 {before} 到 {after}。",
  "Confirm relic reroll. Spend 3 Diamonds. Balance {before} to {after}. Replaces all three relic choices.": "確認遺物重投。花費3鑽石。平衡 {before} 到 {after}。替換所有三個遺物選擇。",
  "Confirm reroll": "確認重投",
  "Confirm Revive · {balance} → {result} Diamonds": "確認復活·{balance}→{result}鑽石",
  "Confirm Sonar · {before}→{after}D": "確認聲納·{before}→{after}D",
  "Confirm Sonar Ping. Spend 2 Diamonds. Balance {before} to {after}.": "確認聲納 Ping。花費2鑽石。平衡 {before} 到 {after}。",
  "Connect matching Forge, Nature, Crystal, or Moon pieces, then start the encounter when the current build is ready.": "連接匹配的鍛造、自然、水晶或月亮部件，然後在當前建造準備就緒時開始遭遇。",
  "Connect three or more. Rescue the target before shots run out.": "連接三個或更多。在子彈用完之前營救目標。",
  "Constellation puzzle": "星座拼圖",
