  "Continue without loot or sell a tray item. A full pack never blocks progress.": "繼續，不要掠奪或出售托盤物品。完整的包永遠不會阻礙進步。",
  "Continuous flight checks the visible collision in small steps. A shot attaches beside the bubble it actually touched instead of jumping to a distant hidden cell.": "連續飛行以小步檢查可見的碰撞。射擊會附著在它實際接觸的氣泡旁邊，而不是跳到遠處的隱藏單元格。",
