  "Copyright 2026 WeightStudio. All rights reserved.": "版權所有 2026 WeightStudio。版權所有。",
  "Coral Ram Ray and Crystal Crown Sovereign cannot lose power while guarded. Use that phase to stabilize so the next opening begins safely.": "珊瑚拉姆鰩魚和水晶皇冠君主在被守衛時不會失去力量。利用該階段來穩定局勢，以便下一個開口安全開始。",
  "Coral Ram Ray and Crystal Crown Sovereign lose power only while their guard is open and the marker is SAFE.": "Coral Ram Ray 和 Crystal Crown Sovereign 僅在其守衛打開並且標記處於安全狀態時才會失去力量。",
  "Coral Shelf": "珊瑚架",
  "Coral Snags": "珊瑚斷枝",
  "Core": "核心",
  "Core critical! Hold the route now.": "核心關鍵！現在保持路線。",
  "Core Foundry": "核心鑄造廠",
  "Core revived.": "核心復活了。",
  "Core Shield": "核心護盾",
  "Core Shield and Faster Recharge stabilize a route under pressure; Bigger Orb and Piercing Shine shorten dangerous Boss phases. Scout Magnet helps long-term growth but does not stop an immediate breach.": "核心護盾和快速充能在壓力下穩定路線；更大的球體和穿透光芒可以縮短危險的 Boss 階段。 Scout Magnet 有助於長期成長，但無法阻止立即違規。",
  "Corn": "玉米",
  "Correct care adds one help. A wrong choice gives a gentle retry; three wrong choices move on without scoring that situation so play cannot soft-lock.": "正確的護理會增加一種幫助。錯誤的選擇會溫和地重試；三個錯誤的選擇在沒有得分的情況下繼續前進，因此遊戲不能軟鎖定。",
  "Correct matches fill one fifth of the progress bar and award a food sticker for the result parade. A wrong box stays available and gives supportive feedback, so the child can look again without losing a life or restarting the level.": "正確的匹配會填滿進度條的五分之一，並為結果遊行獎勵一張食物貼紙。錯誤的盒子會保持可用狀態並提供支持性回饋，因此孩子可以再次查看而不會失去生命或重新啟動關卡。",
  "Correct!": "正確！",
  "Corrosion rewards a shorter fight because Defense loses value each turn. Shields instead reward one large opening strike after the barrier is removed.": "腐蝕會獎勵更短的戰鬥，因為防禦每回合都會失去價值。相反，在屏障被移除後，盾牌會獎勵一次大規模的開局攻擊。",
  "Cosmetic gold frame for every deployed defender. Costs 15 Diamonds.": "每個部署的防守者都有金色的裝飾框。花費 15 鑽石。",
  "Cost": "成本",
  "Costs 1 Energy to clear. If held when ending the turn, take 2 damage.": "消耗 1 能量來清除。如果在回合結束時持有，則受到 2 點傷害。",
  "Costs 1 Energy. Energy {energy} to {remaining}.": "消耗 1 點能量。能量 {energy} 至 {remaining}。",
  "Count both honey impacts and avoid leaving its second hit until the last bubble.": "計算兩次蜂蜜撞擊的數量，並避免將第二次撞擊留到最後一個氣泡為止。",
  "Count mud as two moves when comparing paths. A one-square shortcut through mud may tie a two-square clean detour.": "比較路徑時將泥土算作兩次移動。穿過泥濘的一格捷徑可能會束縛一條兩格乾淨的繞道。",
  "Count mud as two when comparing routes.": "比較路線時，將泥土算為兩個。",
  "Count occupied cells, not only item cards. One large object may block several future links.": "計算佔用的儲存格，而不僅僅是物品卡。一個大物件可能會阻塞多個未來連結。",
