  "Cross clockwork halls during the blue slow phase. The amber field border and guardian glow indicate that the faster sweep is active.": "在藍色慢速階段穿過發條大廳。琥珀色的字段邊界和守護發光錶示更快的掃描已啟動。",
  "Cross-lane": "跨車道",
