  "Cross-lane volley": "跨車道截擊",
  "Crown Festival challenges combine rules. The finale uses Narrow Window, River Wind, Heavy Gravity, and Fixed Queue together; this changes spatial planning, motion prediction, landing time, and future-piece knowledge in the same run.": "皇冠節挑戰結合了規則。結局將「窄窗」、「河風」、「重重力」、「固定隊列」結合；這會在同一運行中改變空間規劃、運動預測、著陸時間和未來片段知識。",
  "Crystal Bats fire three-shot spreads, Armored Boars resist frontal damage until a missed patrol turn opens their guard, Charger Boars burst across a lane, Ember Wolves leave temporary fire, Dive Bats pursue vertically, Rift Bats blink between perches, and Mirror Wolves split once into two fragile echoes.": "水晶蝙蝠發射三發散彈，裝甲野豬抵抗正面傷害，直到錯過的巡邏回合打開他們的守衛，衝鋒野豬衝過一條車道，灰燼狼留下臨時火力，潛水蝙蝠垂直追擊，裂縫蝙蝠在棲息處眨眼，鏡狼一次分裂成兩個脆弱的迴聲。",
