  "Current / O2 -18": "目前/O2 -18",
  "Current and next previews allow two-color planning. Drag or hold to aim; arrow keys adjust the same logical point and Enter or Space fires.": "目前和下一個預覽允許兩種顏色規劃。拖曳或按住以瞄準；方向鍵調整相同的邏輯點並按 Enter 或 Space 觸發。",
  "Curving Ravens and guarded enemies change target priority. Prism Basilisk alternates protected and open windows; skills break its guard faster.": "彎曲的烏鴉和守衛的敵人會改變目標優先順序。棱鏡蛇怪交替受保護和打開的視窗；技能破防速度更快。",
