  "Cut the vine, drag the leaf, and bounce fruit into the animal basket.": "砍斷藤蔓，拖動葉子，將水果彈進動物籃裡。",
  "Cut vine": "砍藤",
  "Cut vines, move the leaf trampoline, and guide fruit to hungry animals in Animal Vine Rescue, a family-friendly animal physics puzzle on WeightPlay.": "在《Animal Vine Rescue》（WeightPlay 上一款適合全家一起玩的動物物理益智遊戲）中，砍斷藤蔓、移動葉子蹦床，並將水果引導給飢餓的動物。",
  "Cyan": "青色",
  "Cyan shadow circles hide Fia from patrol sight. Bell Warden gives a visible warning before each pulse; Fia gains Alert if she remains outside shadow when the bell rings.": "青色陰影圈使 Fia 無法被巡邏人員發現。 Bell Warden 在每次脈衝前發出明顯的警告；如果菲亞在鈴聲響起時仍在陰影之外，則會獲得警報。",
