  "Dash attack": "衝刺攻擊",
  "Dash is both movement and defense. Use it through a projectile fan or across the last part of a charge, then turn and slash during the enemy recovery instead of dashing only for speed.": "衝刺既是移動也是防禦。使用它穿過彈扇或衝鋒的最後部分，然後在敵人恢復期間轉身並砍殺，而不是僅僅為了速度而衝刺。",
  "Day": "日",
  "Day {day}": "天 {day}",
  "Day complete": "一天完成",
  "Days 1-5: Picture Orders.": "第 1-5 天：圖片訂單。",
  "Days 11-15 require a waiting VIP to be served first. Days 16-20 alternate Table A and Table B. Days 21-25 ask for a different animal next whenever another species is eligible.": "第 11-15 天需要先為等待的 VIP 提供服務。第 16-20 天交替使用表 A 和表 B。第 21-25 天，只要有其他物種符合條件，就要求接下來選擇不同的動物。",
  "Days 11-15: VIP Service.": "第 11-15 天：VIP 服務。",
  "Days 16-20: Twin Tables.": "第 16-20 天：雙桌。",
  "Days 21-25: Animal Variety.": "第 21-25 天：動物品種。",
  "Days 26-29 combine two earlier rules. Day 30 activates recipe order, VIP priority, table alternation, and animal variety together.": "第 26-29 天結合了先前的兩條規則。第 30 天同時啟動食譜訂購、VIP 優先、餐桌輪換和動物品種。",
  "Days 26-30: Festival Week.": "第 26-30 天：節日週。",
  "Days 6-10 require the exact visible 1-2-3 order. Selecting the right ingredients in a different order is not accepted, so the recipe numbers carry real meaning.": "第 6-10 天需要精確可見的 1-2-3 順序。不接受以不同的順序選擇正確的成分，因此配方編號具有真正的意義。",
  "Days 6-10: Recipe Steps.": "第 6-10 天：食譜步驟。",
  "Days, coins, best result, and upgrades are stored locally in this browser.": "天數、硬幣、最佳結果和升級都儲存在該瀏覽器本地。",
  "Deal 14 damage and draw 1 card.": "造成 14 點傷害並抽 1 張卡片。",
  "Deal 6 damage. If another attack was played this turn, deal 12 instead.": "造成 6 點傷害。如果本回合進行了另一次攻擊，則改為處理 12。",
  "Deal heavy damage to the closest target.": "對最近的目標造成嚴重傷害。",
  "Decide how to leave a fragile square before entering it.": "在進入一個脆弱的方格之前決定如何離開它。",
  "Decide whether the optional treasure is worth its longer route. It supplies the third medal and extra Moon Coins, but ordinary progress never requires it.": "決定可選的寶藏是否值得走更長的路。它提供第三枚獎牌和額外的月亮幣，但普通的進步從來不需要它。",
  "Deck": "甲板",
  "Decrease bullet firing interval by 20%.": "子彈發射間隔減少 20%。",
  "Deep Camouflage": "深迷彩",
  "Deep Camouflage reduces the animal's contrast and enlarges its foreground grass, leaf, water, or dust cover. Keyboard focus and compass hints restore a strong readable cue, keeping the rule discoverable without making the target disappear.": "深度偽裝會降低動物的對比度並放大其前景草、樹葉、水或灰塵覆蓋物。鍵盤焦點和指南針提示恢復了強大的可讀提示，保持規則可發現，而不會使目標消失。",
  "Deep Camouflage:": "深度迷彩：",
  "Deep-Sea Route Risk Adventure": "深海航線風險冒險",
  "Deeper camouflage rewards slower edge-to-center scanning; later stages combine order and pairs.": "更深的偽裝會獎勵較慢的邊緣到中心掃描；後期階段結合了順序和對。",
  "Deeper games": "更深層的遊戲",
  "DEF {amount} absorbs your next damage.": "DEF {amount} 吸收你的下一個傷害。",
  "Defeat {count} Shadow Scouts": "擊敗 {count} 暗影斥候",
  "Defeat every enemy, choose a permanent Rune Reward, and review saved XP, Runes and mission progress.": "擊敗每一個敵人，選擇永久的符文獎勵，並查看已儲存的經驗值、符文和任務進度。",
  "Defeat every enemy, choose one permanent Rune Reward, and review the exact saved XP, Runes, best mission and next upgrade gap.": "擊敗每一個敵人，選擇永久的符文獎勵，並查看準確保存的 XP、符文、最佳任務和下一個升級差距。",
  "Defeat ordinary threats while watching for charges, ranged bolts, shields, regeneration, slow and silence effects.": "擊敗普通威脅，同時注意衝鋒、遠程螺栓、護盾、再生、緩慢和沈默效果。",
  "Defeat the complete encounter. Victory saves the stage and unlocks the next one; defeat offers retry without deleting prior clears.": "徹底擊敗遭遇戰。勝利拯救這一關並解鎖下一關；失敗提供重試而不刪除先前的清除。",
  "Defeat the delayed Elite in Rooms 1 and 2, collect its Golden Key, open the chest and decide whether to equip the named drop or keep the current loadout.": "在房間 1 和 2 中擊敗延遲的精英，收集其金鑰匙，打開寶箱並決定是否裝備指定的掉落物或保留當前的裝備。",
  "Defeat the fifth encounter to save the stage. Stages 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30 are Guardian checkpoints.": "擊敗第五場戰鬥以挽救舞台。第 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 階段是守護者檢查站。",
  "Defeat the Shadow Sovereign": "擊敗暗影君主",
  "Defeat the third elite or checkpoint Boss before HP reaches zero.": "在生命值為零之前擊敗第三個精英或關卡Boss。",
  "Defeat! Your squad fainted.": "失敗！你的小隊暈倒了。",
  "Defeated {enemy}. Draft a new card.": "擊敗{enemy}。起草一張新卡。",
  "Defeated enemies leave XP crystals. Filling the XP bar pauses the patrol and offers three of the six available upgrades.": "擊敗的敵人會留下 XP 水晶。填滿 XP 條會暫停巡邏，並提供六種可用升級中的三種。",
  "Defeats restore 3 Wall HP": "失敗恢復 3 牆 HP",
  "Defend the yard!": "保衛院子！",
  "Defender HP bonus {current} to {next}": "防禦者 HP 加值 {current} 至 {next}",
  "Defender sold.": "後衛賣了。",
