  "Do I aim the Ranger&#39;s projectiles?": "我是否瞄準遊騎兵的彈體？",
  "Do I always need every fruit?": "我總是需要每種水果嗎？",
  "Do I control attacks during battle?": "戰鬥中我可以控制攻擊嗎？",
  "Do I have to move quickly?": "我必須快速行動嗎？",
  "Do I have to spend both attribute points?": "我必須花掉兩個屬性點嗎？",
  "Do I lose a new item if I keep my current gear?": "如果我保留目前裝備，我會失去新物品嗎？",
  "Do I need Diamonds to finish the campaign?": "我需要鑽石來完成活動嗎？",
  "Do I need Diamonds to progress?": "我需要鑽石才能進步嗎？",
  "Do not accept every loot item. Empty space can be more valuable than a weak object when Orla's shop or a Guardian is still ahead.": "不要接受所有戰利品。當奧拉的商店或守護者仍在前方時，空曠的空間可能比脆弱的物體更有價值。",
  "Do not accept loot automatically. Keeping space for a later shop item can improve the final build.": "不要自動接受戰利品。為以後的商店物品保留空間可以改善最終的建造。",
  "Do not always aim at the closest enemy. Anchors, splitters, and backline wisps can create more pressure than a slow front target, so use a bank route to reach the correct priority.": "不要總是瞄準最近的敵人。錨、分離器和後線小束可以比緩慢的前方目標產生更大的壓力，因此請使用銀行路線來達到正確的優先順序。",
  "Do not attack into riposte. Block, draw or apply Poison until the stance changes.": "不要攻擊還擊。格擋、抽取或施加毒藥，直到姿態改變。",
  "Do not chase every fast beast. Hold a useful firing lane and move early when a hawk or tiger begins a dash.": "不要追逐每隻快速的野獸。守住一條有用的射擊路線，並在鷹或老虎開始猛衝時儘早移動。",
  "Do not circle every room in the same direction. Reverse when ranged bolts fill the outside lane, and cut across an orbiter after it commits to its arc.": "不要將每個房間都朝同一方向環繞。當遠程螺栓填滿外側通道時反轉，並在軌道飛行器進入弧線後橫穿軌道飛行器。",
  "Do not close every cell. A sealed route turns the maze into a direct fight against the nearest blocker and can remove the timing advantage you were trying to create.": "不要關閉每個單元格。封閉的路線會將迷宮變成與最近的阻擋者的直接戰鬥，並且可以消除您試圖創造的時間優勢。",
  "Do not collect a full ticket box if the current challenge specifically asks you to keep it ready.": "如果當前挑戰特別要求您準備好票箱，請勿收集完整的票箱。",
  "Do not collect a full ticket box when the current challenge asks you to keep it ready.": "當當前挑戰要求您準備好票箱時，請勿收集完整的票箱。",
  "Do not enter a fragile square simply because it is highlighted. Decide which side you want to leave from, because returning is not allowed.": "不要僅僅因為一個脆弱的方塊被突出顯示而進入它。決定從哪一邊出發，因為不允許返回。",
  "Do not spend Owl's range on Thorn Boar from an adjacent cell. A two-cell hit avoids the melee counter and keeps the back line useful.": "不要將貓頭鷹的射程花在鄰近牢房的荊棘野豬身上。兩格命中可以避免近戰反擊並保持後線有用。",
  "Do not spend the second jump immediately. Keep it available until a moving ledge, spread shot, or active ground lane confirms where the safe landing will be.": "不要立即進行第二次跳躍。保持其可用，直到移動壁架、分散射擊或活動地面車道確認安全著陸位置。",
