  "Drag the red knob, slide across the sea, or use Left and Right to follow the moving green band.": "拖曳紅色旋鈕，滑過大海，或使用向左和向右跟隨移動的綠色帶。",
  "Drag the red knob, slide on the sea, or use Left and Right arrows to stay inside the green SAFE area.": "拖曳紅色旋鈕，在海面上滑動，或使用向左和向右箭頭留在綠色安全區域內。",
  "Drag through adjacent stars or tap them one by one. Never reuse a trail.": "拖曳相鄰的星星或一一點擊它們。切勿重複使用路徑。",
