  "Eight large food tiles are available. Tap the pictured foods to build a tray, then tap the matching customer. The tray can be cleared before delivery if the selection is wrong.": "有八個大的食物瓷磚可供選擇。點擊圖中的食物來建立一個托盤，然後點擊匹配的顧客。如果選擇錯誤，可以在出貨前清盤。",
