  "Enemy HP": "敵方生命值",
  "Enemy rules are positional, not just statistical. Wolves gain Pack Fang while adjacent to another Wolf. Ravens target the hero with the lowest health ratio. Stone Stag restores first-hit armor. Thorn Boar returns one damage after a surviving adjacent melee hit. Rune Fox teleports behind the weakest hero. Tide Turtle gives the nearest ally a one-hit guard, while Relic Heron pushes the hero it strikes. Cinder Ram charges a visible straight line instead of walking normally.": "敵人的規則是位置性的，而不僅僅是統計性的。狼在與另一隻狼相鄰時獲得群牙。烏鴉的目標是生命值最低的英雄。石鹿恢復首擊護甲。荊棘野豬在倖存的相鄰近戰攻擊後返回 1 點傷害。符文狐狸傳送到最弱的英雄身後。潮汐龜為最近的盟友提供一擊防護，而遺物蒼鷺則推動它擊中的英雄。灰燼公羊沒有正常行走，而是沿著可見的直線衝鋒。",
  "Enemy rules are positional. Adjacent Wolves gain Pack Fang, Ravens hunt the weakest hero, and Stone Stag restores first-hit armor. Thorn Boar counters surviving adjacent melee hits, Rune Fox teleports behind the weakest hero, Tide Turtle guards an ally, Relic Heron pushes its target, and Cinder Ram charges a straight line.": "敵人的規則是位置性的。相鄰的狼獲得群牙，烏鴉獵殺最弱的英雄，石鹿恢復首擊護甲。荊棘野豬反擊倖存的相鄰近戰攻擊，符文狐瞬移到最弱的英雄身後，潮汐龜守護盟友，遺跡蒼鷺推動目標，灰燼公羊直線衝鋒。",
  "Enemy rules:": "敵人規則：",
