  "Enter Room 3 with the HP and run upgrades that survived the earlier rooms, then defeat its Elite or regional Guardian.": "帶著 HP 進入房間 3，並運行在早期房間中倖存下來的升級，然後擊敗其精英或地區守護者。",
  "Enter the Mist Forest.": "進入迷霧森林。",
