  "Formation: the upper three slots are the front row and the lower three are the back row. Targeting matters because some units attack the lead enemy, Moon Cap Owl hunts the back row, and Boom Mane Lion sweeps a full row.": "陣型：上三槽為前排，下三槽為後排。瞄準很重要，因為有些單位會攻擊領先的敵人，月帽貓頭鷹會獵殺後排，而轟鬃獅則會橫掃一整排。",
