  "Fruit": "水果",
  "Fruit acceleration uses the route's gravity and active wind. The leaf adds upward velocity and horizontal direction based on where the fruit hits its surface. A centered contact creates a straighter bounce; an edge contact sends the fruit farther sideways. Missing the basket or leaving the playfield opens a supportive Retry Result without removing saved progress.": "水果加速利用路線的重力和主動風。葉子根據果實撞擊其表面的位置增加向上速度和水平方向。居中的接觸會產生更直的彈跳；邊緣接觸將水果向側面傳送得更遠。錯過籃框或離開比賽場地會打開支援性的重試結果，而不會刪除已儲存的進度。",
  "Fruit bowl": "水果盤",
  "Fruit rescued!": "水果獲救了！",
  "Gadget offers rerolled.": "小工具優惠重新推出。",
  "Gain 15 Block.": "獲得 15 塊。",
  "Gain 6 Block.": "獲得 6 塊。",
  "Gain a card or equipment for future runs.": "獲得一張卡或設備以供將來運行。",
  "Gale push!": "大風推！",
  "Gale Scouts open with fast damage and Coil Lynxes overload the most common material in the pack, disabling those link bonuses. Splitting a build between two materials reduces that risk. The Tempest Archon combines an opening strike with chain-lightning damage for every isolated item.": "狂風偵察兵打開時會造成快速傷害，而盤旋山貓則會使包中最常見的材料超載，從而禁用這些鏈接獎勵。將構建拆分為兩種材料可以降低這種風險。暴風雨執政官將開場攻擊與連鎖閃電傷害結合在一起，對每個孤立的物品造成傷害。",
  "Game guide": "遊戲指南",
  "Game Guide": "遊戲指南",
