  "Garden Parade:": "花園巡遊：",
  "Garden Parade: A successful match rotates the remaining cards through their open spaces, so the mental map must follow movement.": "花園遊行：一場成功的比賽會將剩餘的牌輪流穿過它們的空位，因此心理地圖必須跟隨移動。",
  "Garden tile board": "花園瓷磚板",
  "Gate": "門",
  "Gate and animals:": "門和動物：",
  "Gate fully upgraded": "大門全面升級",
