  "Inside SAFE. Hold steady.": "安全局內。保持穩定。",
  "Inside the Eclipse Heart, follow the safe ring first and treat keys outside it as optional until the next pulse passes.": "在日食之心內，首先沿著安全環走，並將安全環外的鑰匙視為可選，直到下一個脈衝通過。",
  "Inspect corners and narrow exits before starting; entering them from the wrong direction can isolate the final cell.": "開始前檢查角落和狹窄出口；從錯誤的方向進入它們會隔離最終的細胞。",
