  "It can practice animal recognition, focus, hand-eye coordination, and simple care ideas such as food, water, cleaning, and play.": "它可以練習動物識別、注意力、手眼協調以及食物、水、清潔和玩耍等簡單的護理理念。",
  "It highlights the next cell in one possible complete route.": "它突出顯示一條可能的完整路線中的下一個單元格。",
