  "It is an automatic match created after cleared snacks fall and the board refills. Consecutive cascades increase the score multiplier.": "這是在清理完的零食掉落並且棋盤重新填滿後創建的自動匹配。連續級聯會增加分數乘數。",
  "It is an automatic match made after cleared snacks fall and the board refills.": "這是清理完的零食落下並重新填滿棋盤後自動進行的匹配。",
  "It is raining.": "正在下雨。",
  "It is stored in this browser. Clearing browser site data or switching devices may remove or separate the save.": "它儲存在該瀏覽器中。清除瀏覽器網站資料或切換裝置可能會刪除或分離儲存。",
  "It is stored in this browser. Clearing site data or switching devices may remove or separate the save.": "它儲存在該瀏覽器中。清除網站資料或切換裝置可能會刪除或分離儲存。",
  "It is too cold.": "天氣太冷了。",
