  "It is too hot.": "天氣太熱了。",
  "It occupies the nearest open position around the bubble physically touched; it should not jump to a distant hidden cell.": "它佔據物理接觸的氣泡周圍最近的打開位置；它不應該跳到遠處的隱藏單元格。",
  "It pulls for longer. Stay patient near the middle.": "它拉的時間更長。在中間附近保持耐心。",
  "It removes 12 unspent sun once, but it never removes an already placed guard.": "它會移除 12 個未消耗的太陽一次，但它永遠不會移除已經放置的守衛。",
  "It removes 12 unspent sun once. Existing guards are not removed, so spending on a needed defense early is a valid response.": "一次可消除 12 個未消耗的陽光。現有的防護措施不會被撤除，因此儘早在所需的防禦上投入資金是一個有效的應對措施。",
  "It requires both a named snack quantity and a score target.": "它需要指定的零食數量和分數目標。",
  "It restores the previous board, score, move count, objective progress, and deterministic spawn state.": "它恢復之前的棋盤、得分、移動計數、目標進度和確定性生成狀態。",
  "It uses the nearest open position around the bubble physically touched.": "它使用物理接觸的氣泡周圍最近的打開位置。",
  "It uses timing pressure, gear choices, collection progress, and optional Diamond spending, so it is deeper than younger-child games.": "它使用計時壓力、裝備選擇、收集進度和可選的鑽石消費，因此它比低齡兒童遊戲更有深度。",
  "Italiano": "義大利人",
