  "Its bright barrier reduces damage while closed. Attack strongly after it opens.": "其明亮的屏障可減少關閉時的損壞。打開後強力攻擊。",
  "Its bright shell barrier reduces damage while closed. Keep the lane blocked and attack strongly when the barrier disappears.": "其明亮的外殼屏障可減少關閉時的損壞。保持車道被封鎖，當障礙物消失時強力攻擊。",
  "Its gills flare CYAN — counter with a PULSE!": "它的鰓呈青色－與脈衝相反！",
