  "Its tail coils RIGHT — it will charge RIGHT!": "它的尾部線圈正確——它將正確充電！",
  "Judge the whole movement line, not only the destination. A safe endpoint can still require too much exposed travel.": "判斷整個運動路線，而不僅僅是目的地。安全終點仍可能需要過多的暴露行程。",
