  "Keep a corner stable and protect empty spaces.": "保持角落穩定並保護空閒空間。",
  "Keep at least one path open, or blocked enemies will attack the nearest defender until the route reopens.": "至少保持一條路徑暢通，否則被阻擋的敵人將攻擊最近的防御者，直到路線重新打開。",
  "Keep bonus treasure after one capture in the next mission. Tap again to confirm: {before} → {after} Diamonds.": "在下一個任務中捕獲一次後保留獎勵寶藏。再次點選確認：{before}→{after}鑽石。",
  "Keep both edges active instead of emptying only one side.": "保持兩側邊緣處於活動狀態，而不是僅清空一側。",
  "Keep both sides of the board moving. Emptying one side too early can leave the opposite edge with fewer useful matches.": "保持板的兩側移動。過早清空一側可能會導致相對邊緣的有用匹配減少。",
  "Keep Cloudline Skyport moving.": "讓 Cloudline Skyport 繼續前進。",
  "Keep coloring": "繼續著色",
  "Keep core HP above zero through Wave 3. Victory saves the next route and Star Stones; failure still saves the earned Star Stones and leaves the best unlocked route intact.": "透過第 3 波將核心生命值保持在零以上。勝利可節省下一條路線和星石；失敗仍可保存獲得的星石，並完好無損地保留最佳的解鎖路線。",
