  "Keep holding while tracing inside the turquoise corridor.": "在綠松石色走廊內追蹤時繼續按住。",
  "Keep large animals low and near the center while preserving an open lane for unmatched small balls.": "將大型動物保持在較低位置並靠近中心，同時為無與倫比的小球保留開放的通道。",
  "Keep matching small animals on the same side, but preserve one open lane for pieces that do not fit the current chain.": "繼續在同一側匹配小動物，但為不適合當前鏈條的棋子保留一條開放通道。",
  "Keep moving the leaf while the fruit falls and bounce it toward the basket.": "當水果掉落時繼續移動葉子並將其彈向籃子。",
  "Keep one continuous hold.": "保持一次連續保持。",
  "Keep playing": "繼續玩",
  "Keep Playing": "繼續玩",
  "Keep ranged coverage near the crystal during Bat Crossing and later flying stages because bats bypass ground blockers. Slow boars before their armor breaks on storm stages so their wounded speed surge is less dangerous.": "在蝙蝠穿越和後來的飛行階段，在水晶附近保持遠程覆蓋，因為蝙蝠會繞過地面阻擋物。在風暴階段，在野豬的盔甲破裂之前減緩它們的速度，這樣它們受傷的速度激增就不那麼危險了。",
  "Keep reading": "繼續閱讀",
  "Keep serving as the queue grows and use earned coins for cafe upgrades.": "隨著隊列的增長繼續服務，並使用賺取的硬幣來升級咖啡館。",
  "Keep steering while the fruit falls and use the leaf contact point to change its direction.": "當水果掉落時保持轉向，並使用葉子接觸點來改變其方向。",
  "Keep steering while the fruit moves. Use the center of the leaf for height or an edge to add sideways distance.": "當水果移動時保持轉向。使用葉子的中心作為高度，或使用邊緣來增加側向距離。",
  "Keep the animal tower under the red warning line.": "將動物塔保持在紅色警戒線以下。",
  "Keep the largest animal near a corner, but avoid filling both neighboring edges with unmatched low tiers.": "將最大的動物放在角落附近，但避免用無與倫比的低層填充兩個相鄰邊緣。",
  "Keep the pile below the red line and complete the current goal before the drop budget ends.": "將堆放在紅線以下並在下降預算結束之前完成當前目標。",
  "Keep the pile below the red line while working toward the current tier, merge-count, combo, score, or dual checkpoint goal.": "保持堆在紅線以下，同時努力實現目前層、合併計數、組合、得分或雙檢查點目標。",
  "Keep the second jump until a moving ledge, spread shot, or hazard cycle confirms the safe landing.": "保持第二次跳躍，直到移動壁架、分散射擊或危險循環確認安全著陸。",
  "Keep the wall above zero HP until every normal beast and Boss is defeated.": "保持牆的生命值高於零，直到擊敗所有普通野獸和 Boss。",
