  "Large bubbles drift up": "大氣泡飄上來",
  "Large-batch bonuses can finish an order with fewer moves, but a group-goal stage still needs the displayed largest clear at least once.": "大批量獎金可以用更少的步數完成訂單，但團體目標階段仍然需要至少一次顯示的最大通關。",
  "Largest": "最大",
