  "Largest group {done}/{need}": "最大組 {done}/{need}",
  "Last Bastion": "最後的堡壘",
  "Last Catch": "最後的收穫",
  "Later chapters add denser plazas, signal-locked carts, convoy order, and mixed four-direction traffic.": "後面的章節增加了更密集的廣場、信號鎖車、車隊秩序和混合四向交通。",
  "Later chapters add overlapping plates, shared screws, locked screws, smaller move limits, and longer release chains.": "後面的章節添加了重疊板、共享螺絲、鎖定螺絲、更小的移動限制和更長的釋放鏈。",
  "Later checkpoints combine these rules. The final challenge offers a preview, then adds mist, gust movement after misses, and parade movement after matches. The board is demanding because memory must be updated, not because the player is rushed.": "後來的檢查點結合了這些規則。最後的挑戰提供了預覽，然後添加了薄霧、未命中後的陣風運動以及比賽後的遊行運動。棋盤的要求很高，因為記憶體必須更新，而不是因為玩家匆忙。",
  "Later combinations require quick lane reading and objective planning. The age label is guidance, not an ability rating.": "後期的組合需要快速的車道讀取和客觀的規劃。年齡標籤是指導，而不是能力評級。",
  "Later enemies change action planning. Ember Salamander leaves a temporary burn tile when it moves. Moon Moth silences one hero's Skill for the next player turn without removing Move, Attack or Guard. Archive Owl marks a hero so the next ranged hit gains damage. Mirror Wolf creates one adjacent one-HP clone when space permits. Seal Raven drains one Energy but never below zero. These traits remain active when Mission 29 combines one threat from five earlier chapters.": "後來敵人改變了行動計畫。灰燼蠑螈移動時會留下暫時燃燒的方塊。月蛾會在下一個玩家回合沉默一名英雄的技能，而不移除移動、攻擊或防禦。檔案貓頭鷹標記英雄，因此下一次遠程攻擊會造成傷害。當空間允許時，鏡狼會創建一個相鄰的一生命值克隆。海豹渡鴉會消耗 1 點能量，但絕不會低於零點。當第 29 任務結合了前五個章節中的一種威脅時，這些特徵仍然活躍。",
  "Later food, mixed and expert stages add a fourth name after the animal library has been introduced.": "後來的食物、混合和專家階段在引入動物庫後添加了第四個名稱。",
  "Later food, mixed, and expert stages add a fourth name after players have learned the animal library.": "後來的食物、混合和專家階段在玩家學會動物庫後添加了第四個名稱。",
  "Later routes combine faster visual decisions, route objectives, and score pressure.": "後面的路線結合了更快的視覺決策、路線目標和得分壓力。",
  "Later stages combine six-unit formations, specialized targeting, permanent upgrades, combat failure pressure, Boss abilities, and optional Diamond decisions. Campaign progress, the last deployed formation and slot positions, Training Gold, Team Level, unlocked animals, permanent animal levels, completed stages, and cosmetic choice are stored locally in this browser; no login is required for basic play. Clearing this site's browser storage may remove that local progress.": "後期階段結合了六單位編隊、專門瞄準、永久升級、戰鬥失敗壓力、Boss 能力和可選的鑽石決策。戰役進度、最後部署的編隊和位置、訓練金幣、團隊等級、解鎖動物、永久動物等級、已完成的階段和化妝品選擇都存儲在該瀏覽器本地；基本遊戲無需登錄。清除此網站的瀏覽器儲存空間可能會刪除該本機進度。",
  "Later threats alter action order. Ember Salamander leaves temporary fire. Moon Moth blocks one Skill turn without blocking Move, Attack or Guard. Archive Owl marks a hero for extra ranged damage. Mirror Wolf creates an adjacent one-HP clone. Seal Raven drains one Energy but never below zero.": "後來的威脅改變了行動順序。灰燼蠑螈留下暫時的火焰。月蛾阻擋一技能回合，且不阻擋移動、攻擊或防禦。檔案貓頭鷹標誌著英雄的額外遠程傷害。鏡狼創造一個相鄰的一生命值克隆體。海豹渡鴉會消耗 1 點能量，但絕不會低於零點。",
  "Layered-wind stages apply different force above and below the middle of the clearing. The fruit may begin toward the animal, then drift away as it descends. Reverse-wind stages switch direction after the first leaf contact.": "分層風階段在空地中部上方和下方施加不同的力。果實可能會開始朝向動物，然後隨著下降而飄走。反向纏繞階段在第一片葉片接觸後切換方向。",
  "Leaf": "葉",
  "Leaf at {value} percent": "葉濃度為 {value}%",
  "Leaf barriers respond to adjacent matches, honey records two impacts, and clouds clear their row. Wind changes the projectile during flight, while shifting levels move alternating rows after each shot.": "葉子屏障對相鄰的匹配做出反應，蜂蜜記錄了兩次撞擊，雲清除了它們的行。風會在飛行過程中改變彈，而水平變化會在每次射擊後交替移動行。",
  "Leaf bubbles drop with an adjacent match": "葉子氣泡隨著相鄰的火柴掉落",
  "Leaf trampoline position": "葉子彈跳床位置",
  "Leaf-and-stone lanes, honey headwind, moving cloud rows, three-animal rescue, and the final mixed Safari Check demand different aiming decisions rather than larger numbers alone.": "樹葉和石頭的小徑、蜂蜜逆風、移動的雲排、三隻動物的救援以及最終的混合狩獵檢查需要不同的瞄準決策，而不僅僅是更大的數字。",
  "Learn wall bounces against scouting beasts.": "學習牆壁彈跳對抗偵察野獸。",
  "Learn what each wild beast does before choosing a stage.": "在選擇階段之前了解每種野獸的用途。",
