  "Leave one legal adjacent cell when Mirror Wolf is present, then remove the one-HP clone before it changes movement and targeting lanes.": "當鏡狼出現時，留下一個合法的相鄰單元格，然後在它改變移動和目標路線之前移除一生命值克隆體。",
