  "Leaves cleared!": "樹葉清除了！",
  "Leaves drop beside matches, honey needs two hits and clouds clear a row.": "樹葉掉落在火柴旁，蜂蜜需要敲擊兩下，雲朵才會散去。",
  "Leaves drop beside matches, honey needs two hits, and clouds clear their row.": "樹葉落在火柴旁邊，蜂蜜需要兩次，雲彩清除了它們的行。",
  "Leaves fall beside a match, honey needs two direct hits, clouds clear a row, wind bends flight and shifting levels move alternating rows after a shot.": "樹葉落在火柴旁邊，蜂蜜需要兩次直接擊中，雲清除一排，風使飛行彎曲，水平變化在一次射擊後交替移動。",
  "Left": "左",
  "LEFT": "左",
  "LEFT CHARGE": "左電荷",
  "LEFT TARGET": "左目標",
  "Leo is a pack breaker: each basic strike cleaves enemies around its target, while his roar disrupts a crowd. Fia is a skirmisher with low health, an invulnerable damaging dash, and the fastest basic attacks. Orla is a long-range hunter whose mark lasts for three empowered follow-up shots. Taro is a bulwark: he takes less damage, slows foes with basic strikes, and can raise a timed guard.": "利奧是個破壞者：每次基本攻擊都會將目標周圍的敵人劈成兩半，而他的咆哮會擾亂人群。菲亞是一名生命值較低、具有無敵破壞性衝刺和最快基本攻擊的散兵。奧拉是一名遠程獵人，其標記持續三次強力後續射擊。太郎是一個堡壘：他受到的傷害較少，透過基本攻擊減慢敵人的速度，並且可以提高定時防禦。",
  "Leo is strongest when several Scouts group inside the same roar radius.": "當多個偵察兵聚集在同一咆哮半徑內時，獅子座最強大。",
  "Leo moves horizontally by dragging or tapping the battlefield; a focused keyboard can also use Left and Right Arrow. Equipped weapons fire automatically, but each slot owns its cooldown, so duplicate weapons still produce separate shots. Pencil, ruler, and eraser builds differ in speed, damage, size, and firing rhythm.": "Leo 透過拖曳或點擊戰場來水平移動；聚焦鍵盤也可以使用向左和向右箭頭。裝備的武器會自動射擊，但每個插槽都有其冷卻時間，因此重複的武器仍然會產生單獨的射擊。鉛筆、尺和橡皮的構建在速度、傷害、大小和發射節奏方面有所不同。",
  "Let's help the next animal.": "讓我們幫助下一個動物。",
