  "Levels": "等級",
  "Levels 1-5 establish fixed-box matching with familiar fruit, vegetables, and pantry foods. Mimi closes the first route by moving the boxes once after the third correct food.": "1-5 級建立了與熟悉的水果、蔬菜和食品儲藏室食物的固定盒匹配。咪咪在第三次正確的食物後移動盒子一次來關閉第一條路線。",
  "Levels 1–5 teach direct shots, bank shots, rescue targets, mixed colors and stones.": "1-5 級教授直接射擊、傾斜射擊、救援目標、混合顏色和石頭。",
  "Levels 1–5: Aim School.": "1-5 級：目標學校。",
  "Levels 11-15 introduce close pairs such as red and pink or blue and cyan, plus one harmless unused box. Nori combines picture-first clues with a decoy choice.": "第 11 至 15 級介紹了緊密的配對，例如紅色和粉紅色或藍色和青色，以及一個無害的未使用的盒子。諾裡將圖片優先的線索與誘餌選擇結合。",
  "Levels 11–15 introduce Burst, Swap, leaf, honey and cloud rules.": "第 11 至 15 級介紹了突發、交換、葉子、蜂蜜和雲規則。",
  "Levels 11–15: Barrier Country.": "11-15 級：屏障國家。",
  "Levels 16-20 group foods by vegetable, fruit, breakfast, and snack themes. Pogo's buffet presents seven boxes for five foods, requiring careful elimination without extending the session.": "16-20 級依蔬菜、水果、早餐和零食主題分組食物。 Pogo 的自助餐有七盒五種食物，需要仔細消除，但不能延長用餐時間。",
  "Levels 16–20 add east/west wind and alternating moving rows.": "16-20 樓增加了東/西風和交替移動的行。",
  "Levels 16–20: Monsoon Paths.": "16-20 級：季風路徑。",
  "Levels 21-25 revisit moving boxes and picture matching in stronger combinations. Taro mirrors the box order once halfway through the garden check.": "第 21-25 級以更強的組合重新審視移動盒子和圖片匹配。太郎在花園檢查進行到一半時就反映了盒子的順序。",
  "Levels 21–25 pair each power with barriers and finish with three rescues plus all four powers.": "21-25 級將每種力量與障礙配對，並以三次救援加上所有四種力量結束。",
  "Levels 21–25: Power Trails.": "第 21-25 級：動力軌跡。",
  "Levels 26-30 use six-box rainbows, warm-and-cool alternation, two decoys, and repeated safe movement. Fia's festival combines picture-only clues, one unused box, and a shuffle after each correct answer.": "26-30 級使用六盒彩虹、冷暖交替、兩個誘餌和重複的安全移動。國際汽聯的節日結合了純圖片線索、一個未使用的盒子以及每個正確答案後的洗牌。",
  "Levels 26–30 combine leaf-and-stone lanes, honey headwind, moving cloud rows and three-animal rescue. Level 30 uses every major rule.": "26 至 30 層結合了樹葉和石頭小徑、蜂蜜逆風、移動雲排和三隻動物救援。 30 級使用所有主要規則。",
  "Levels 26–30: Grand Reunion.": "第 26-30 級：盛大團聚。",
  "Levels 6-10 compare warm, cool, light, and dark colors. A picture-only picnic removes visible words, and Orla's check rearranges boxes after every successful match.": "6-10 級比較暖色、冷色、淺色和深色。僅限圖片的野餐會刪除可見的文字，奧拉的檢查會在每次成功配對後重新排列方框。",
  "Levels 6–10 expand rescue chains and introduce Rainbow and Line Clear.": "第 6 至 10 級擴大了救援鏈並引入了 Rainbow 和 Line Clear。",
  "Levels 6–10: Rescue Routes.": "6-10 級：救援路線。",
  "Light every trail to finish the constellation and unlock the next stage.": "照亮每條痕跡以完成星座並解鎖下一階段。",
  "Light every trail to restore the constellation and unlock the next stage.": "照亮每條痕跡以恢復星座並解鎖下一階段。",
  "Lightning Dash": "閃電衝刺",
  "Line broke. The tension marker left the safe band too long.": "線斷了。張力標記離開安全帶太長。",
  "Line Clear removes the entire row it hits": "行清除會刪除它所命中的整行",
  "Line control: after a bite, drag the red knob, slide on the sea, or use Left and Right. SAFE control removes fish power. Remaining outside the band too long breaks the line, returns to casting, and leaves the mission clock running.": "線路控制：咬一口後，拖曳紅色旋鈕，在海上滑動，或使用左、右。安全控制消除了魚的力量。在樂隊之外停留太久就會打破路線，返回選角，並讓任務時鐘繼續運行。",
