  "Narrow Window reduces aim space, River Wind applies alternating sideways force, Heavy Gravity changes Matter.js gravity, and Fixed Queue uses an authored generation rhythm.": "Narrow Window 減少了目標空間，River Wind 應用交替的側向力，Heavy Gravity 改變了 Matter.js 的重力，Fixed Queue 使用了編寫的生成節奏。",
