  "Play a marked card before ending the turn; drawing more can make it harder to locate.": "在結束回合前打出一張標記牌；畫得越多，定位就越困難。",
  "Play Again": "再玩一次",
  "Play Animal Quiz on WeightPlay, a family-friendly animal knowledge game with picture-supported questions about habitats, features, and animal facts.": "在 WeightPlay 上玩動物測驗，這是一款適合家庭的動物知識遊戲，其中包含有關棲息地、特徵和動物事實的圖片支援問題。",
  "Play Animal Shape Train on WeightPlay, a gentle preschool animal train game for matching colorful shapes, practicing early logic, and building hand-eye coordination.": "在 WeightPlay 上玩《動物形狀火車》，這是一款溫和的學前動物火車遊戲，用於匹配彩色形狀、練習早期邏輯並建立手眼協調能力。",
  "Play Beast Deck: The Mist Forest, a 30-mission animal deckbuilder with ten regional mechanics, six phase-changing Bosses, local cards and gear.": "暢玩 Beast Deck：The Mist Forest，這是一款包含 30 個任務的動物牌組構建器，擁有 10 個區域機制、6 個階段性 Boss、本地卡牌和裝備。",
