  "Playful Gust": "俏皮風",
  "Playful Gust moves unmatched cards after a miss, while Garden Parade rotates them after a successful pair.": "頑皮的狂風會在未命中後移動不匹配的牌，而花園巡遊會在成功配對後輪換它們。",
  "Playful Gust moves unmatched cards after a miss; Garden Parade rotates them after a match.": "頑皮的陣風在失誤後移動無與倫比的牌；花園遊行在比賽結束後輪換他們。",
