  "Recommended Age": "推薦年齡",
  "Recommended for ages 9+ and family play. One Line practices hand-eye coordination, focus, and route control through play. It requires no account and uses no formal ability ranking.": "建議 9 歲以上兒童和家庭玩耍。 One Line 透過遊戲練習手眼協調能力、專注力和路線控制。它不需要帳戶，也不使用正式的能力排名。",
  "Recommended for ages 9+ and family puzzle play. A round usually takes two to six minutes and practices logic, focus, and problem solving through play. Stage unlocks, best star ratings, best times, and constellation progress are stored only in this browser. No account is required, and the Skill Report is supportive game feedback rather than a formal assessment.": "建議 9 歲以上兒童和家庭益智遊戲使用。一輪通常需要兩到六分鐘，透過遊戲練習邏輯、注意力和解決問題的能力。階段解鎖、最佳星級、最佳時間和星座進度僅儲存在此瀏覽器中。不需要帳戶，技能報告是支持性的遊戲回饋，而不是正式的評估。",
  "Recommended for ages 9+. The puzzles practise visual planning and flexible problem solving; they are not an ability test.": "建議 9 歲以上兒童使用。謎題練習視覺規劃和靈活解決問題；它們不是能力測驗。",
  "Recommended for ages 9+. The puzzles practise visual scanning and planning; they are not an ability test.": "建議 9 歲以上兒童使用。謎題練習視覺掃描和規劃；它們不是能力測驗。",
  "Recommended next": "推薦下一個",
  "Recover quickly after a broken line. On Guardian missions, read the named boss rule and any armor cue before making a large correction.": "斷線後迅速恢復。在守護者任務中，在進行大規模修正之前，請先閱讀指定的 Boss 規則和任何裝甲提示。",
  "Recover relics, read hazards, and surface before oxygen runs out.": "回收文物，了解危險，並在氧氣耗盡之前浮出水面。",
  "Recover the mission object": "恢復任務對象",
  "Recover the mission object and then reach the active extraction marker. If a rule identifies treasure as the first seal, the mission object cannot be collected until that treasure seal is open.": "回收任務物體，然後到達活動的撤離標記。如果規則將寶藏指定為第一個封印，則在該寶藏封印開啟之前無法收集任務物件。",
  "Recover the valid mission object and reach extraction; optional treasure earns an extra medal and Moon Coins.": "恢復有效的任務物件並到達撤離點；可選的寶藏可以獲得額外的獎牌和月亮幣。",
