  "Reef Map": "珊瑚礁地圖",
  "Reef Notes": "珊瑚礁註釋",
  "Reef Notes are field credits for the rod, reel, line, bait, boat, and scanner. Every fifth mission reaches a habitat marker guarded by Sun Crown Guardian, Kelp Leviathan, Coral Ram Ray, Eclipse Manta, Storm Lantern Warden, or Crystal Crown Sovereign. Landing one completes its five-mission chart. Mission 30 restores all six charts and records the final deep-water Guardian.": "礁石註釋是魚竿、釣線輪、魚線、魚餌、船和掃描器的現場記錄。每五個任務都會到達一個由太陽皇冠守護者、海帶利維坦、珊瑚拉姆鰩魚、日蝕蝠鱝、風暴燈籠守護者或水晶皇冠君主守衛的棲息地標記。著陸一號完成了它的五項任務圖。第 30 號任務恢復了所有六張海圖並記錄了最後的深水守護者。",
  "Reef Notes are field credits used to improve the survey gear. Each fifth mission reaches a habitat marker guarded by Sun Crown Guardian, Kelp Leviathan, Coral Ram Ray, Eclipse Manta, Storm Lantern Warden, or Crystal Crown Sovereign. Landing the Guardian validates that region's chart. Mission 30 files the sixth chart and ends the campaign without creating Mission 31.": "珊瑚礁筆記是用於改善調查裝備的現場積分。每第五個任務都會到達一個由太陽皇冠守護者、海帶利維坦、珊瑚拉姆鰩魚、日食蝠鱝、風暴燈籠守護者或水晶皇冠君主守衛的棲息地標記。登陸衛報驗證了該地區的圖表。任務 30 提交第六張圖表並結束戰役，但未建立任務 31。",
  "Reef zones": "珊瑚礁區",
  "Refresh all three blessing choices once this wave. Costs 3 Diamonds. Current balance {balance}.": "這一波刷新所有三個祝福選項。花費 3 鑽石。當前餘額{balance}。",
  "Refresh all three blessings once this wave. Tap again to confirm: {before} → {after} Diamonds.": "這一波刷新全部三個祝福。再次點選確認：{before}→{after}鑽石。",
  "Refresh for 3 Diamonds": "刷新3鑽石",
  "REG {amount} heals after enemy actions.": "REG {amount} 在敵人行動後治癒。",
  "Regenerating {amount} HP": "恢復 {amount} HP",
  "Regional mechanics: armor reduces each direct hit; riposte counters the next Attack; Exhaust raises one card's next cost; marks punish ending with a named card; Weak reduces the next Attack. Regeneration heals, cleanse removes Poison, haste skips through intent order, fog hides an intent, and seals disable one card type for a turn.": "區域機制：裝甲減少每次直接命中；反擊反擊下一次攻擊；耗盡會提高一張卡的下一次費用；以指定卡片標記懲罰結尾；弱會減少下一次攻擊。再生可以治愈，淨化可以消除毒藥，急速可以跳過意圖順序，霧氣可以隱藏意圖，而封印則可以在一個回合中禁用一種卡牌類型。",
  "Regional mechanics: armor reduces each direct hit; riposte counters the next Attack; Exhaust raises one card&#39;s next cost; marks punish ending with a named card; Weak reduces the next Attack. Regeneration heals, cleanse removes Poison, haste skips through intent order, fog hides an intent, and seals disable one card type for a turn.": "區域機制：裝甲減少每次直接命中；反擊反擊下一次攻擊；耗盡會提高一張卡的下一次費用；以指定卡片標記懲罰結尾；弱會減少下一次攻擊。再生可以治愈，淨化可以消除毒藥，急速可以跳過意圖順序，霧氣可以隱藏意圖，而封印則可以在一個回合中禁用一種卡牌類型。",
  "Reinforcing armor by {amount}": "{amount} 加強裝甲",
