  "Release to cast. Step 2 starts when a fish bites.": "釋放即可施放。當魚咬鉤時，第 2 步開始。",
  "Release to fire the spirit-orb volley. Watch armor rings, phase outlines, charge marks, anchor protection, and Boss cues before choosing the next shot.": "釋放以發射靈魂球齊射。在選擇下一個射擊之前，請注意裝甲環、階段輪廓、衝鋒標記、錨點保護和 Boss 提示。",
  "Release to move": "鬆開即可移動",
