  "Rod Strength removes fish power faster. Reel Control makes the marker follow the chosen position more smoothly. Line Durability both widens the safe band and improves control. Bait Quality increases catch Notes and contributes to landing speed. Boat Range extends the mission clock. Reef Scanner expands the species pool that can appear in earlier regions, which helps fill missing album entries without changing the mission goal. Each item has five saved levels and uses Reef Notes rather than Diamonds.": "魚竿強度可以更快消除魚的力量。捲軸控制使標記更平滑地跟隨所選位置。線路耐用性既拓寬了安全範圍，也提高了控制能力。餌料品質可提高捕獲量並有助於提高著陸速度。船靶場延長了任務時鐘。珊瑚礁掃描儀擴展了早期區域中可能出現的物種庫，這有助於在不改變任務目標的情況下填補缺少的相簿條目。每個項目都有五個已保存的級別，並使用礁石筆記而不是鑽石。",
  "Roguelike": "Roguelike",
  "Roguelite": "輕度 Rogue",
  "Role": "角色",
  "Room": "房間",
  "Room {room}/3": "房間 {room}/3",
