  "Sandwich": "三明治",
  "Savanna Feeding": "稀樹草原餵養",
  "Savanna Trail": "稀樹草原步道",
  "Save Burst for dense barriers and Line Clear for a row containing several obstacles or rescue bubbles.": "對於密集的障礙物，請保存「爆裂」；對於包含多個障礙物或救援氣泡的行，請儲存「清線」。",
  "Save Burst for dense barriers and Line Clear for valuable rows.": "對於密集的障礙物，請保存“爆裂”，對於有價值的行，請保存“清線”。",
  "Save role coverage for Boss stages. The final Voidroot Emperor changes phase at two health thresholds, summoning bats first and then armored ground support while rebuilding guard.": "儲存 Boss 階段的角色覆蓋範圍。最終的虛根皇帝會在兩個生命值閾值處改變相位，首先召喚蝙蝠，然後在重建守衛時召喚地面裝甲支援。",
  "Save sonar pings for harder zones or rare shimmer movement.": "將聲納脈衝保存在較困難的區域或罕見的閃光運動中。",
  "Save the optional Diamond reroll for a blessing set that genuinely misses the route's rule. Normal route unlocking and all six Bosses remain playable without spending Diamonds.": "保留可選的鑽石重滾以獲得真正違反路線規則的祝福套裝。正常路線解鎖，所有六個 Boss 都可以在不花費鑽石的情況下玩。",
  "Save the optional Diamond reroll for a blessing set that genuinely misses the route&#39;s rule. Normal route unlocking and all six Bosses remain playable without spending Diamonds.": "保留可選的鑽石重滾以獲得真正違反路線規則的祝福套裝。正常路線解鎖，所有六個 Boss 都可以在不花費鑽石的情況下玩。",
  "Save wall repair and defeat-healing choices for breaker-heavy stages such as Buffalo Siege and Crocodile Siege.": "為布法羅圍攻和鱷魚圍攻等破壞重重的階段保留牆壁修復和失敗治療選擇。",
  "Saved Level": "已儲存等級",
