  "SCAN": "掃描",
  "Scan 2⚡": "掃描2⚡",
  "Scan from the bottom upward. A low clear moves more bubbles and can connect animals that were separated across several rows.": "從下往上掃描。低透明可移動更多氣泡，並且可以將分散在幾行中的動物連接起來。",
  "Scan from the bottom upward. Clearing a low group moves more bubbles and creates more possible connections.": "從下往上掃描。清除低組會移動更多氣泡並創造更多可能的連結。",
  "Scan one strip of the scene at a time instead of jumping between distant bright shapes.": "一次掃描場景的一小部分，而不是在遠處的明亮形狀之間跳躍。",
  "Scan previews by corners or rows.": "按角落或行掃描預覽。",
  "Scan the lower half first. A low clear moves more tiles and creates more chances for a cascade.": "先掃描下半部。低清可以移動更多的方塊並為瀑布創造更多的機會。",
  "Scan the whole track again after every match on a moving route.": "在移動路線上的每場比賽結束後再次掃描整個賽道。",
