  "Score {target} points": "得分 {target} 分",
  "Score 0": "得分 0",
  "Score goal": "進球得分",
  "Score information": "分數資訊",
  "Score stages ask for a total number of points. Collection stages count only the named snack. Pair stages accept either of two named snacks, which creates more possible routes but also asks the player to watch two colors at once. Big-match stages require one clear containing four, five, or six tiles. Cascade stages require a falling refill to create a second or third automatic match. Checkpoint stages combine a specific collection order with a score target, so neither half can be ignored.": "分數階段要求總分。收集階段僅計算指定的零食。配對階段接受兩種指定零食中的任何一種，這創造了更多可能的路線，但也要求玩家同時觀看兩種顏色。大型比賽階段需要包含四塊、五塊或六塊磁磚的清場。級聯階段需要下降的補充來創建第二個或第三個自動匹配。檢查點階段將特定的收集順序與分數目標結合起來，因此任何一半都不能被忽略。",
  "Score, collection, pair, cascade, big-match, and dual checkpoint goals ask for different plans.": "得分、收集、配對、級聯、大型比賽和雙檢查點目標需要不同的計劃。",
  "Scores and favorites stay on this device.": "樂譜和收藏夾保留在此設備上。",
  "Scores are for fun and local progress tracking only.": "分數僅供娛樂和本地進度追蹤。",
  "Scores are for fun and local progress tracking only. They are not an IQ test, medical diagnosis, psychological test, or formal school assessment.": "分數僅供娛樂和本地進度追蹤。它們不是智商測驗、醫學診斷、心理測驗或正式的學校評估。",
  "Scores are for fun and progress tracking only.": "分數僅用於娛樂和進度追蹤。",
  "Scout Magnet": "偵察磁鐵",
  "Scout the route before starting.": "出發前先勘察路線。",
  "Scout Tower": "偵察塔",
  "Scout: {enemies}. First battle: {first}.": "偵察兵：{enemies}。第一場戰鬥：{first}。",
  "Screw puzzle board": "螺絲拼圖板",
  "Sea Conditions and Guardian Rules": "海況和監護人規則",
  "Sea conditions: Open Water is stable; Kelp Drift moves the band; Coral Snags changes its width; Moon Tide switches sides; Storm Gust applies a timed line push; Abyss Trial combines drift, pressure, and gusts.": "海況：開闊水域穩定；海藻漂流讓樂團感動不已；珊瑚障礙會改變其寬度；月潮改變立場；風暴陣風應用定時線路推送；深淵試煉結合了漂移、壓力和陣風。",
  "Seal and rescue objectives share the same board. The key opens protected routes while the two starred families remain visible goals beneath later layers.": "海豹和救援目標共用同一個棋盤。鑰匙打開了受保護的路線，而兩個帶有星號的家庭在後面的層下仍然是可見的目標。",
  "SEALED: {type}": "密封：{type}",
  "Sealing {type} cards": "密封 {type} 卡",
  "Seals": "密封件",
  "Search animal, puzzle, memory...": "搜尋動物、拼圖、記憶...",
