  "Search paused": "搜尋已暫停",
  "Search: {query}": "搜尋：{query}",
  "Seed": "種子",
  "Seedling Walk, 1-5:": "幼苗行走，1-5：",
  "Select a weapon to view damage, cooldown and merge details.": "選擇武器以查看傷害、冷卻時間和合併詳細資訊。",
  "Select an item from the tray. Tap an open green cell to place it, or rotate the selected shape before trying another position.": "從托盤中選擇一個項目。點擊開啟的綠色儲存格進行放置，或在嘗試其他位置之前旋轉選定的形狀。",
  "Select an unlocked route from the horizontal Stage rail. The card states its objective and active route rules before play begins.": "從水平舞台導軌中選擇一條未鎖定的路線。該卡在比賽開始前說明其目標和活動路線規則。",
  "Select Cat, Dog, Owl, or an owned Fox, then tap an empty grass tile in the lane that needs help.": "選擇貓、狗、貓頭鷹或擁有的狐狸，然後點擊需要幫助的車道上的空草塊。",
  "Select equipment from the tray, rotate it when useful, and place it on a valid green cell in the 11 x 7 pack.": "從托盤中選擇設備，在有用時旋轉它，然後將其放置在 11 x 7 包中的有效綠色單元上。",
  "Select Leo, Fia, Orla, or Taro. Hero selection and unlocked progress are saved locally.": "選擇 Leo、Fia、Orla 或 Taro。英雄選擇和解鎖進度均保存在本地。",
  "Select Lion, Owl or Turtle on the board or in the Squad Action roster. Choose an adjacent highlighted cell to move, a highlighted enemy to attack, Guard, or Skill.": "在面板或小隊行動名冊中選擇獅子、貓頭鷹或烏龜。選擇要移動的相鄰突出顯示的儲存格、要攻擊的突出顯示的敵人、守衛或技能。",
  "Select Lion, Owl or Turtle, then move to a highlighted cell, attack a highlighted enemy, Guard, or use Skill.": "選擇獅子、貓頭鷹或烏龜，然後移動到突出顯示的單元格，攻擊突出顯示的敵人、守衛或使用技能。",
  "Select one free tile, then another free tile with the same picture. A valid match removes both together. Selecting a different picture keeps the newer tile selected and explains that a match is still needed.": "選擇一個免費圖塊，然後選擇另一個具有相同圖片的免費圖塊。有效的匹配會將兩者一起刪除。選擇不同的圖片會使較新的圖塊保持選取狀態，並說明仍需要匹配。",
  "Select one of these ancient relics to empower your explorer.": "選擇這些古代文物之一來增強您的探險家的能力。",
  "Select one of these ancient relics to empower your wolf.": "選擇這些古代遺物之一來增強你的狼的力量。",
  "Select one relic to buff your squad for the entire expedition run.": "選擇一件遺物來增強你的小隊在整個探險過程中的能力。",
