  "Shadow Boar": "暗影野豬",
  "Shadow Brute": "暗影蠻族",
  "Shadow Brute attacks blockers quickly, Forest Behemoth summons escorts, Ironbark Colossus rebuilds armor, Verdant Ancient heals, Tempest Ravager hastens allies, and Voidroot Emperor changes phase twice.": "暗影蠻族快速攻擊阻擋者，森林巨獸召喚護衛，鐵樹巨像重建護甲，蒼翠遠古治療，風暴掠奪者催促盟友，虛根皇帝兩次改變相位。",
  "Shadow Claw: All units gain +1 Attack in battle.": "暗影之爪：所有單位在戰鬥中攻擊力+1。",
  "Shadow Fox Scout": "影狐斥候",
  "Shadow foxes apply steady pressure, panthers close quickly, and crystal boars absorb more attacks. Later stages add breakable shields, announced charges, scorch ground, drifting drops, mirrored strikes, and a moving Eclipse safe ring.": "暗影狐施加穩定的壓力，黑豹快速接近，水晶野豬吸收更多攻擊。後期階段增加了易碎護盾、宣布衝鋒、焦土、漂流掉落、鏡像打擊和移動的日蝕安全環。",
  "Shadow Furnace": "暗影熔爐",
  "Shadow Scouts chase directly. Prism Ravens approach on curved flight. Ember Boars show a warning before charging. Moon Hunters maintain distance and fire periodically. Abyss Guards reduce ordinary damage until hero skills break their guard.": "暗影斥候直接追擊。棱鏡烏鴉以曲線飛行方式接近。灰燼野豬在充電前會顯示警告。月球獵人保持距離並定期開火。深淵守衛會減少普通傷害，直到英雄技能打破他們的守衛。",
  "Shadow Wolf": "暗影狼",
  "Shadow Wolf arena": "影狼競技場",
  "Shadow Wolf game guide": "暗影之狼遊戲攻略",
  "Shadow Wolf internal arena": "影狼內部競技場",
  "Shadow Wolf Legend": "影狼傳奇",
  "Shadow Wolf Legend cover": "影狼傳奇封面",
  "Shadow Wolf Legend Game Guide": "暗影狼傳奇遊戲指南",
  "Shadow Wolf Legend Internal Test | WeightPlay": "影狼傳奇內測| WPB品牌代幣",
  "Shadow Wolf Legend is a 30-stage side-scrolling action-platform campaign. Guide the explorer wolf across ruined ledges, read visible hazard warnings, fight shadow creatures, collect EXP, and spend two exact attribute points whenever a level is gained. Every fifth stage ends with a regional Boss whose defense or attack pattern requires a different response.": "Shadow Wolf Legend 是一款包含 30 個階段的橫向捲軸動作平台戰役。引導探險狼穿過廢墟壁架，閱讀可見的危險警告，與暗影生物戰鬥，收集經驗值，並在升級時花費兩個精確的屬性點。每第五個階段都會以一個區域 Boss 結束，其防禦或攻擊模式需要不同的回應。",
