  "Skill Report": "技能報告",
  "Skill Report: {stars}/3 Stars. Clear win with {core}% core HP. For a perfect clear, upgrade blockers earlier and stretch the route before burst waves.": "技能報告：{stars}/3 星。以 {core}% 核心生命值明顯勝出。為了獲得完美的暢通，請儘早升級阻擋物並在爆發波浪之前拉長路線。",
  "Skill Report: {stars}/3 Stars. Close clear with {core}% core HP. Add Medic or Sapper support sooner and avoid sealing the route too early.": "技能報告：{stars}/3 星。以 {core}% 核心 HP 關閉清除。儘早增加醫療兵或工兵支援，避免過早封鎖路線。",
  "Skill Report: {stars}/3 Stars. Strong route planning kept the core at {core}%. Next, time hero focus fire even earlier on bosses.": "技能報告：{stars}/3 星。強大的路線規劃使核心保持在 {core}%。接下來，時間英雄會更早向 Boss 集中火力。",
  "Skill Report: good practice. Next run, aim earlier and use walls to hit multiple beasts.": "技能報告：良好的練習。下一次奔跑，更早瞄準並使用牆壁擊中多個野獸。",
  "Skill Report: good practice. Upgrade gear and keep the marker inside the safe band earlier.": "技能報告：良好的練習。升級裝備並儘早將標記保持在安全範圍內。",
  "Skill Report: Logic, Problem Solving, and Focus practiced through path planning and upgrade timing.": "技能報告：透過路徑規劃和升級時機練習邏輯、解決問題和專注力。",
  "Skill Report: strong focus and reaction. You managed line tension while choosing safer casts.": "技能報告：強烈的專注力和反應力。您在選擇更安全的鑄件的同時控制了線張力。",
  "Skill Report: strong logic and reaction. You used bounce planning and upgrade choice to protect the fortress.": "技能報告：邏輯性強，反應性強。您使用彈跳計劃和升級選擇來保護堡壘。",
  "Skill Report: The core fell. Reshape the route, keep one readable path open, and upgrade key blockers before the next pressure wave.": "技能報告：核心掉落。重塑路線，保持一條可讀路徑暢通，並在下一次壓力波到來之前升級關鍵攔截器。",
