  "Snack Blocks game guide": "零食塊遊戲指南",
  "Snack Blocks is intended for ages 9+ and family play because later stages combine two goals, changing snack pools, and cascade planning. Its local Skill Report is supportive run feedback, not a diagnosis, school assessment, or comparison with other children.": "Snack Blocks 適合 9 歲以上兒童和家庭遊戲，因為後期階段結合了兩個目標：更換零食池和級聯規劃。其當地的技能報告是支持性的跑步回饋，而不是診斷、學校評估或與其他孩子的比較。",
  "Snack Blocks is intended for ages 9+ and family play because later stages combine two goals, changing snack pools, and cascade planning. The local Skill Report summarizes only events from the current run. It is supportive play feedback, not an intelligence test, diagnosis, school assessment, or comparison with other children. The game is free, needs no login, and stores unlocked stages and records only in the current browser.": "Snack Blocks 適合 9 歲以上兒童和家庭遊戲，因為後期階段結合了兩個目標：更換零食池和級聯規劃。本地技能報告僅總結目前運行的事件。這是支持性的遊戲回饋，而不是智力測驗、診斷、學校評估或與其他孩子的比較。該遊戲是免費的，無需登錄，並且僅在當前瀏覽器中儲存解鎖的階段和記錄。",
