  "Solve 30 picture, habitat, feature, action, and food investigations.": "解決 30 項圖片、棲息地、特徵、動作和食物調查。",
  "Solve enough situations to reach the goal, save stars, and unlock the next mission.": "解決足夠的情況以達到目標、拯救星星並解鎖下一個任務。",
  "Some challenges ask the park to prepare a ready box. Collect only after that goal is satisfied.": "有些挑戰要求公園準備一個現成的盒子。僅在滿足該目標後收集。",
  "Some challenges test whether the park can prepare income without immediately spending it. Collect only after that goal is satisfied.": "一些挑戰測試公園是否可以在不立即支出的情況下準備收入。僅在滿足該目標後收集。",
  "Some images could not load; available art will be used": "部分圖片無法載入；將使用現有的藝術",
  "Some sealed missions require optional treasure as the first seal before the mission object becomes valid.": "一些密封任務需要可選的寶藏作為任務對像生效之前的第一個密封。",
  "Some stages require groups of three or four before any bubbles can clear. Queue stages place a bright outline around the animal that must be served next; clearing another animal changes the board but does not advance its later counter. Bonus-batch stages make a sufficiently large group count extra toward the active order. Group-goal stages require one clear at least as large as the displayed target in addition to finishing all recipe counters.": "有些階段需要三到四人一組才能清除氣泡。排隊階段在接下來必須提供服務的動物周圍放置了明亮的輪廓；清除另一隻動物會改變棋盤，但不會推進其後面的計數器。獎勵批次階段使足夠大的組對活躍訂單額外計數。除了完成所有配方計數器之外，團體目標階段還需要清除至少與顯示目標一樣大的目標。",
