  "Spark Paw Fox carries replacement stars through every route. Zebra Pathfinder, Rhino Trailkeeper, Hippo Waterwarden, Eagle Skykeeper, Lion Pridekeeper, and Elephant Crownkeeper each test one five-route region before reopening it. Clearing Route 30 reconnects all six regions.": "Spark Paw Fox 帶著替補明星走過每條路線。斑馬探路者、犀牛守護者、河馬水衛者、鷹天空守護者、獅子驕傲守護者和象冠守護者在重新開放之前分別測試一個五路線區域。清理 30 號公路將重新連接所有六個區域。",
