  "Special Beasts and Counterplay": "特殊野獸與反擊",
  "Special enemies change the layout problem. Shields absorb opening damage, Ambushers strike before the normal exchange, isolation adds damage for unlinked items, corrosion removes Defense over time, top-row heat punishes occupied ventilation cells, overload suppresses the pack's most common tag, and rotating seals cycle among all four materials.": "特殊的敵人改變了佈局問題。護盾吸收開口傷害，伏擊者在正常交換之前發動攻擊，隔離會增加對未連接物品的傷害，腐蝕會隨著時間的推移消除防禦，頂排熱量會懲罰佔用的通風單元，過載會抑制包裝中最常見的標籤，並且旋轉密封件會在所有四種材料之間循環。",
  "Special enemies:": "特殊敵人：",
  "Special enemies: Crystal Bats fire spreads, Armored Boars open after a missed patrol turn, Charger Boars burst across lanes, Ember Wolves leave fire, Dive Bats pursue vertically, Rift Bats blink between perches, and Mirror Wolves split once into two fragile echoes.": "特殊敵人：水晶蝙蝠火力蔓延，裝甲野豬在錯過巡邏轉彎後打開，衝鋒野豬衝過車道，灰燼狼離開火力，潛水蝙蝠垂直追擊，裂縫蝙蝠在棲息地之間眨眼，鏡狼分裂成兩個脆弱的迴聲。",
  "Special enemies: Ironbark stages give enemies breakable guard armor; mistwood enemies recover health while moving; storm enemies accelerate after falling below half health; eclipse stages combine armor, recovery, surge behavior, flying routes, and reduced slow effectiveness.": "特殊敵人：鐵皮階段為敵人提供可破壞的護甲；迷霧林敵人在移動時恢復生命值；風暴敵人在生命值低於一半後會加速；日食階段結合了裝甲、恢復、激增行為、飛行路線和降低的緩慢效果。",
