  "Spend important sun before a thief's pouch activates.": "在小偷的袋子被激活之前，要好好曬曬太陽。",
  "Spend one Energy to remove one. Holding it at turn end deals two damage and cycles it through discard.": "花費 1 點能量來消除 1 點。在回合結束時握住它會造成兩次傷害並循環丟棄。",
  "Spend runes to permanently upgrade each animal hero.": "花費符文永久升級每個動物英雄。",
  "Spend saved upgrade points from Stage when permanent power, bulwark health, or starting economy needs improvement. Optional Diamond actions always show their cost and require confirmation.": "當永久力量、堡壘健康或啟動經濟需要改進時，請使用舞台上節省的升級點。可選的鑽石操作始終會顯示其成本並需要確認。",
  "Spend shared WeightPlay diamonds on special animal guards.": "將共享的 WeightPlay 鑽石用於特殊的動物守衛。",
  "Spend stage coins to place soldiers or WeightPlay heroes on normal ground tiles. Use the visible range preview before confirming a position.": "花費階段金幣將士兵或 WeightPlay 英雄放置在普通地磚上。在確認位置之前使用可見範圍預覽。",
  "Spend tickets on the gate, one of three facilities, or a new animal.": "在大門、三個設施之一或新動物上花費門票。",
  "Spend upgrade points earned from victories. Upgrades are local-only and optional.": "花費從勝利中獲得的升級積分。升級僅限本地且可選。",
  "Spirit orb is flying. Watch the bounce route and prepare the next aim.": "靈珠飛舞。觀察彈跳路線並準備下一個目標。",
