  "Stealth Route Adventure": "秘密路線冒險",
  "Steam Toads increase corrosion, while Furnace Boars turn occupied cells in the top row into incoming heat damage. Leaving ventilation space can be more valuable than filling every cell. The Furnace Leviathan combines heat and corrosion, so its stage rewards healing, burst damage, and a deliberately open top row.": "蒸氣蟾蜍會增加腐蝕，而熔爐野豬會將頂排中被佔用的細胞轉化為傳入的熱損傷。留下通風空間比填滿每個細胞更有價值。熔爐利維坦結合了熱和腐蝕，因此它的階段獎勵治療、爆發傷害和故意開放的頂排。",
  "Step 1: hold the sea to charge, then release to cast.": "步驟1：握住大海蓄力，然後放開施放。",
  "STEP 1: Use SONAR to reveal the safe lane.": "第 1 步：使用 SONAR 揭示安全車道。",
  "Step 2: drag the red knob, or slide on the sea, into SAFE.": "步驟2：拖曳紅色旋鈕，或在海上滑動，進入SAFE。",
  "STEP 2: Tap the green SAFE lane.": "第 2 步：點選綠色安全車道。",
