  "Sticky Mud has weighted cost, making a direct route potentially less efficient.": "黏泥具有加權成本，使得直接路線的效率可能較低。",
  "Sticky Mud uses a weighted cost of two, so route efficiency is not always the same as square count.": "Sticky Mud 使用 2 的加權成本，因此路線效率並不總是與平方數相同。",
  "Sticky Mud:": "黏泥：",
  "Stone Stag": "石鹿",
  "Stop every beast while at least one cottage heart remains. A no-breach clear awards that stage&#39;s permanent Garden Medal.": "阻止所有野獸，同時至少留下一顆小屋之心。無違規明確授予該階段永久花園獎章。",
  "Storage Bench": "儲物凳",
  "Storm Gust": "風暴陣風",
  "Storm gusts follow a three-second rhythm. Hold near the middle of the current band before the flash, then correct after the push.": "風暴陣風遵循三秒的節奏。在閃光之前按住當前頻段的中間附近，然後在推動後糾正。",
  "Storm gusts occur on a three-second rhythm. Hold near the middle of the current safe band before the next flash, then correct after the push.": "風暴以三秒的節奏發生。在下一次閃光之前保持在當前安全帶的中間附近，然後在推動後糾正。",
