  "Thorn anchor": "荊棘錨",
  "Thorn beasts favor armor and crowded lanes.": "荊棘獸喜歡盔甲和擁擠的車道。",
  "Thorn Bridge": "荊棘橋",
  "Threat": "威脅",
  "Threat rules: rushers alternate a slow stalk with a fast charge; shooters hold range and fire relic bolts; pulsers launch radial rings; splitters release two rushers when defeated; wards cancel a fixed number of projectile hits; regenerators heal after avoiding damage; slowing beasts reduce movement on contact; orbiters travel around the explorer; silencers temporarily stop automatic fire. Region 6 combines these rules instead of introducing a larger copy of a basic animal.": "威脅規則：衝鋒者交替進行慢速攻擊和快速衝鋒；射手持有射程和火焰遺物箭；脈衝發生器發射徑向環；分裂者被擊敗後會釋放兩個衝鋒者；病房取消固定數量的投射物命中；再生器在避免傷害後癒合；減速的野獸會減少接觸時的移動；軌道飛行器在自動飛行器；消音器暫時停止；第 6 區結合了這些規則，而不是引入基本動物的更大副本。",
  "Three blocked taps end the patrol, so look first.": "三個被堵塞的水龍頭結束了巡邏，所以先看一下。",
  "Three Diamonds reroll one reward set, and 18 Diamonds confirm the permanent Training Slot. Diamonds do not unlock campaign missions, heroes or Bosses.": "三顆鑽石重滾一組獎勵，18 顆鑽石確認永久訓練槽位。鑽石不能解鎖戰役任務、英雄或頭目。",
  "Three encounters give two draft choices enough time to matter without creating an endurance run. Intent stays visible unless fog is the rule, tying losses to readable decisions. Mission 30's numerical ceiling remains close to the former eight-mission version; difficulty now comes from overlapping mechanics. Phone and desktop use the same card order and tap/click actions. Unlike Animal Auto Squad's pre-battle planning, Beast Deck resolves every turn; unlike Animal Rune Tactics, it replaces grid position with draw order, Energy and discard timing.": "三場比賽給了兩個選秀選擇足夠的時間來發揮作用，而不會產生耐力跑。除非迷霧成為規則，否則意圖始終可見，將損失與可讀的決策聯繫起來。 Mission 30 的數量上限仍然接近先前的 8 個任務版本；現在的困難來自於重疊的機制。電話和桌面使用相同的卡片順序和點擊/點擊操作。與 Animal Auto Squad 的戰前計劃不同，Beast Deck 會解決每個回合；與動物符文戰術不同，它用繪製順序、能量和丟棄時間取代網格位置。",
  "Three encounters give two draft choices enough time to matter without creating an endurance run. Intent stays visible unless fog is the rule, tying losses to readable decisions. Mission 30&#39;s numerical ceiling remains close to the former eight-mission version; difficulty now comes from overlapping mechanics. Phone and desktop use the same card order and tap/click actions. Unlike Animal Auto Squad&#39;s pre-battle planning, Beast Deck resolves every turn; unlike Animal Rune Tactics, it replaces grid position with draw order, Energy and discard timing.": "三場比賽給了兩個選秀選擇足夠的時間來發揮作用，而不會產生耐力跑。除非迷霧成為規則，否則意圖始終可見，將損失與可讀的決策聯繫起來。 Mission 30 的數量上限仍然接近先前的 8 個任務版本；現在的困難來自於重疊的機制。電話和桌面使用相同的卡片順序和點擊/點擊操作。與 Animal Auto Squad 的戰前計劃不同，Beast Deck 會解決每個回合；與動物符文戰術不同，它用繪製順序、能量和丟棄時間取代網格位置。",
  "Three guests begin each day and more can join. Each order bubble shows the required foods and each card shows remaining patience. A guest who waits too long leaves and reduces the business rating; the day pauses only if rating reaches zero.": "每天由三位客人開始，更多客人可以加入。每個訂單氣泡顯示所需的食物，每張卡片顯示剩餘的耐心。客人等待時間過長離開，降低商務評價；僅當評級達到零時，這一天才會暫停。",
  "Three lanes keep choices readable on phones, and every input moves exactly one lane. Captured swipes remain reliable across the Canvas edge, while held keyboard input cannot skip lanes. Route timers range from 28 to 45 seconds for quick retries. Depth comes from information changes: gates alter spatial reading, star trails alter risk and reward, mud alters recovery timing, objectives alter success, and Guardians use authored sequences. The Kids build is ad-free and creates no ad reserve.": "三個通道使選擇在手機上可讀，每個輸入都恰好移動一個通道。捕獲的滑動在 Canvas 邊緣仍然可靠，而保持的鍵盤輸入不能跳過通道。路線計時器範圍為 28 至 45 秒，用於快速重試。深度來自資訊變化：大門改變空間解讀，星軌改變風險和獎勵，泥土改變恢復時間，目標改變成功，守護者使用創作的序列。兒童版本沒有廣告，也不建立廣告儲備。",
  "Three or more connected bubbles of one animal color clear. Bank levels count a match only after the projectile has touched a wall.": "三個或更多相連的一種動物顏色的氣泡透明。只有當彈丸接觸到牆壁後，銀行水平才算為匹配。",
  "Three or more connected colors clear. Bank goals count only a group made after touching a wall; rescue goals require one to three marked animal bubbles.": "三種或更多相連的顏色清晰。銀行進球只計算碰壁後的一組進球；救援目標需要一到三個標記的動物氣泡。",
  "Three unsafe arrivals closed the shift. Retry is free.": "三名不安全的抵達結束了輪班。重試是免費的。",
  "Three-Room Hero Action Trials": "三室英雄動作試煉",
  "Three-room runs:": "三房運行：",
  "Three-wave route: Waves 1 and 2 establish the route's enemy rule. Wave 3 uses an authored elite formation, except Routes 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30, which end with a named regional Boss. A cleared wave pauses inside Battle for one blessing choice, then resumes the same route with surviving core HP and current upgrades.": "三波路線：第一波和第二波確立了這條路線的敵人統治。第 3 波使用精心設計的精英陣型，但 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 號路線除外，這些路線以指定的區域 Boss 結尾。一波清除的浪潮會在戰鬥中暫停以獲得一個祝福選擇，然後以剩餘的核心生命值和當前的升級恢復相同的路線。",
  "Three-wave route: Waves 1 and 2 establish the route&#39;s enemy rule. Wave 3 uses an authored elite formation, except Routes 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30, which end with a named regional Boss. A cleared wave pauses inside Battle for one blessing choice, then resumes the same route with surviving core HP and current upgrades.": "三波路線：第一波和第二波確立了這條路線的敵人統治。第 3 波使用精心設計的精英陣型，但 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 號路線除外，這些路線以指定的區域 Boss 結尾。一波清除的浪潮會在戰鬥中暫停以獲得一個祝福選擇，然後以剩餘的核心生命值和當前的升級恢復相同的路線。",
