  "Tidy Habitat raises happiness, while Enrichment Time awards tickets. Both share a short care cooldown, so the current goal should guide the choice.": "整潔的棲息地提升幸福感，豐富的時光則獎勵門票。兩者都有較短的護理冷卻時間，因此當前的目標應該指導選擇。",
  "Tidy Habitat raises happiness. Enrichment Time awards tickets. Both share a short cooldown.": "整潔的棲息地可以提高幸福感。豐富時間獎勵門票。兩者的冷卻時間都很短。",
  "Tidy Habitat raises happiness. Enrichment Time awards tickets. Both use the same short care cooldown.": "整潔的棲息地可以提高幸福感。豐富時間獎勵門票。兩者都使用相同的短期護理冷卻時間。",
