  "Touch and mouse players may tap or drag through the same care transaction; keyboard players use the same native buttons and focus sequence. Stage, Battle, and Result keep one logical composition that scales uniformly on phones, tablets, desktop, and short landscape screens. Unlike Animal Quiz, this game asks what kind of care tool fits the moment rather than which animal matches a fact. The Kids route has no account, purchase, leaderboard, advertising request, or ad reserve.": "觸控和滑鼠玩家可以透過點擊或拖曳來完成相同的護理交易；鍵盤演奏者使用相同的本機按鈕和焦點順序。舞台、戰鬥和結果保持一種邏輯組合，在手機、平板電腦、桌上型電腦和短橫向螢幕上統一縮放。與動物測驗不同，遊戲詢問哪種護理工具適合當前情況，而不是哪種動物符合事實。兒童路線沒有帳戶、購買、排行榜、廣告請求或廣告儲備。",
