  "Tower, pyramid, and sanctuary layouts combine seals, rescues, and alternating patrol routes. Board 30 contains twelve pairs over three layers and ends the campaign without creating a Board 31.": "塔樓、金字塔和聖殿佈局結合了海豹突擊隊、救援隊和交替巡邏路線。 Board 30 在三層中包含 12 對，並在不創建 Board 31 的情況下結束活動。",
  "Toy": "玩具",
