  "Trail Key and Gate: A golden key must be collected before its gate accepts a move.": "蹤跡鑰匙和大門：在其大門接受移動之前必須收集金鑰匙。",
  "Trail menu": "步道選單",
  "Trail result": "追蹤結果",
  "Trail Seal boards hold marked inner tiles until the glowing diamond pair clears. Family Rescue boards track two starred matching families. Ranger Trial combines seal and rescue; Grand Reserve adds the alternating patrol route.": "Trail Seal 板固定有標記的內部瓷磚，直到發光的鑽石對清除。家庭救援委員會追蹤兩個加星號的配對家庭。遊俠審判結合了海豹和救援；大保護區增加了交替巡邏路線。",
  "Trails": "步道",
