  "Train and position a six-animal squad across 30 five-wave stages, six regions, varied enemy formations, and six unique bosses.": "在 30 個五波階段、六個區域、不同的敵人陣型和六個獨特的 Boss 中訓練和部署一支六動物小隊。",
