  "Treasure becomes the first of two seals, changing collection order. Crossed paths, shadow shelters, and changing patrol speed are combined before Vault Sealkeeper guards the central route at the checkpoint.": "寶藏成為兩個封印中的第一個，改變了收集順序。在避難所封印守衛在檢查站守衛中央路線之前，交叉路徑、陰影庇護所和不斷變化的巡邏速度結合在一起。",
  "Treasure cache: +2 salvage, -16 oxygen.": "寶物：+2 打撈，-16 氧氣。",
