  "Treat a mismatch as useful location information on classic boards.": "將不匹配視為經典棋盤上的有用位置資訊。",
  "Treat a retry as a calm chance to compare the four pictures again.": "將重試視為再次比較四張圖片的冷靜機會。",
  "Treat arrows, numbers, keys, and gates as route constraints rather than decoration.": "將箭頭、數字、鑰匙和門視為路線約束而不是裝飾。",
  "Treat bell and guardian glow warnings as decisions. Enter shadow before the pulse or pursuit begins, then plan the next route from cover.": "將鈴聲和守護者發光警告視為決定。在脈衝或追擊開始之前進入陰影，然後從掩體中規劃下一條路線。",
  "Treat the pale attack ring as a spacing guide and stay near its outer edge.": "將蒼白的攻擊環作為間距引導並保持在其外緣附近。",
  "Trial Cleared!": "審判通過！",
