  "Unlocked and completed routes, the selected route, and the local Top 5 are stored in this browser.": "已解鎖和已完成的路線、已選擇的路線以及本地前 5 條路線都儲存在該瀏覽器中。",
  "Unlocked and completed stages, Workshop XP, discoveries, and best encounter progress are stored locally in this browser.": "已解鎖和已完成的階段、創意工坊 XP、發現和最佳遭遇進度都儲存在該瀏覽器本地。",
  "Unlocked and completed stages, Workshop XP, discoveries, and best progress are stored locally.": "已解鎖和已完成的階段、創意工坊 XP、發現和最佳進度都儲存在本地。",
  "Unlocked and saved · {balance} diamonds remain.": "解鎖並保存 · 剩餘 {balance} 鑽石。",
  "Unlocked animals appear in your expedition backpack. Permanent levels are saved locally.": "解鎖的動物會出現在您的探險背包中。永久級別保存在本地。",
  "Unlocked challenges and best stars are stored locally in this browser.": "解鎖的挑戰和最佳星星存儲在該瀏覽器本地。",
  "Unlocked missions are saved on this device.": "解鎖的任務保存在此裝置上。",
