  "When a fish is hooked, drag in the tension lane and keep the red marker inside the safe band.": "當魚上鉤時，將其拖入張力線並將紅色標記保持在安全帶內。",
  "When a gate is visible, locate its key first and make sure the route from key to gate is not cut off by water.": "當門可見時，請先找到門的鑰匙，並確保從鑰匙到門的路線沒有被水切斷。",
  "When a species appears twice, remember which side still has its unfinished partner.": "當一個物種出現兩次時，記住哪一邊還有未完成的夥伴。",
  "When an extra box has no matching food, treat it as a looking clue rather than guessing quickly.": "當多餘的盒子沒有匹配的食物時，將其視為尋找線索，而不是快速猜測。",
  "When rows shift, re-read the board after every shot instead of repeating the same angle.": "當行移動時，每次射擊後重新閱讀棋盤，而不是重複相同的角度。",
  "When the fish appears, follow the green band with the red marker instead of forcing every fight back to the center.": "當魚出現時，沿著帶有紅色標記的綠色帶移動，而不是強迫每次戰鬥都回到中心。",
  "When the line breaks, cast again immediately. On Guardian missions, read the boss cue before making a large correction.": "當線斷時，立即重新投擲。在守護者任務中，在做出大的修正之前先閱讀老闆的提示。",
  "When three minutes expire, the stage clears only if its key and Boss objectives are complete. Losing all HP or missing an objective leaves the stage available for another attempt.": "三分鐘結束後，只有完成其關鍵目標和 Boss 目標後，該階段才會被清除。失去所有生命值或錯過目標後，舞台就可以進行另一次嘗試。",
