  "Winning moves directly to the next wave. Preparation reopens after a loss or draw while the run still has Hearts, so the initial formation should be able to handle more than one enemy pattern.": "獲勝直接進入下一波。輸球或平局後，當跑動仍有紅心時，準備工作會重新開始，因此初始陣型應該能夠應對多種敵人模式。",
  "Wisp Gallery": "小精靈畫廊",
  "With four choices, remove animals that cannot live in the stated habitat or eat the named food.": "有四種選擇，移除不能生活在指定棲息地或吃指定食物的動物。",
  "With two clues, decide which need has immediate priority.": "透過兩條線索，確定哪個需求具有直接優先順序。",
